(117320, 5312, 2909, '<td valign="top">Good detail and lighting.</td>', 'Good detail and lighting.', '2002-09-09 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117321, 5312, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this and the way the plate curves through the picture.  Teh colors seem a little off to me, though.  They blend together.  Maybe if the pears had been brighter, and the plate was a solid color and it was on a contrasting surface it would have more punch.  Still a nice job, though.  karmat</td>', 'I like the composition of this and the way the plate curves through the picture.  Teh colors seem a little off to me, though.  They blend together.  Maybe if the pears had been brighter, and the plate was a solid color and it was on a contrasting surface it would have more punch.  Still a nice job, though.  karmat', '2002-09-09 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117322, 5312, 2361, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  A more pleasing plate might have pushed me to an 8 or 9.  7 Jak</td>', 'Very nice image.  A more pleasing plate might have pushed me to an 8 or 9.  7 Jak', '2002-09-09 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117323, 5312, 3080, '<td valign="top">We have those same paper plates!  I think they add a nice touch of color behind the pears.  The focus and clarity are great.  I love the detail on the pears.  The background behind the plate adds a bit of "coutry" look.  The angle and framing is great.  I like how the pears are off centered, rather than centered.  Great job.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'We have those same paper plates!  I think they add a nice touch of color behind the pears.  The focus and clarity are great.  I love the detail on the pears.  The background behind the plate adds a bit of "coutry" look.  The angle and framing is great.  I like how the pears are off centered, rather than centered.  Great job.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117324, 5312, 3178, '<td valign="top">The pears are very attractive, but the background doesn''t add anything to the picture. 5</td>', 'The pears are very attractive, but the background doesn''t add anything to the picture. 5', '2002-09-11 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117325, 5312, 2928, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good lighting, high quality shot.  Meets the challenge.  But, there''s something not quite right that I can''t quite put my finger on; perhaps it''s subliminal  only I can''t abide pears (7)</td>', 'Good composition, good lighting, high quality shot.  Meets the challenge.  But, there''s something not quite right that I can''t quite put my finger on; perhaps it''s subliminal  only I can''t abide pears (7)', '2002-09-11 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117326, 5312, 2011, '<td valign="top">When looking at the thumbnail of this I didnt think that I was going to like it.  But seeing the full size I really like the colors and composition.  Looks like its setting on the kitchen table.Good work 8 boyte1</td>', 'When looking at the thumbnail of this I didnt think that I was going to like it.  But seeing the full size I really like the colors and composition.  Looks like its setting on the kitchen table.Good work 8 boyte1', '2002-09-11 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117327, 5312, 3832, '<td valign="top">This is a good, natural shot.  The lighting is very good, and the paper plate on the plaid table cloth accentuates a ''country living'' theme.  A very nice composition.  Good job!</td>', 'This is a good, natural shot.  The lighting is very good, and the paper plate on the plaid table cloth accentuates a ''country living'' theme.  A very nice composition.  Good job!', '2002-09-11 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
