(117366, 5315, 3208, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites in this challenge - amazing colour, good texture of mushroom, nice shadow under mushroom and the darker section at the top persuades my eyes to look at the mushroom again and again.  My only (minor) niggle is that the focus seems to falter at the extremes of the mushroom... perhaps this is the only way you could imrpove this photo.  10 without a doubt because, to me, this is ART.</td>', 'This is one of my favourites in this challenge - amazing colour, good texture of mushroom, nice shadow under mushroom and the darker section at the top persuades my eyes to look at the mushroom again and again.  My only (minor) niggle is that the focus seems to falter at the extremes of the mushroom... perhaps this is the only way you could imrpove this photo.  10 without a doubt because, to me, this is ART.', '2002-09-10 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
