(117461, 5335, 3832, '<td valign="top">The photographer did everything right with this shot except the angle.  It is a little boring, looking at it from this end.</td>', 'The photographer did everything right with this shot except the angle.  It is a little boring, looking at it from this end.', '2002-09-11 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117462, 5335, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The composition is perhaps a little too central; try cropping the image to one side, this would  in my opinion - improve the balance of the of the very strong background over the central subject. But that''s really only a small beef, and having said that, it''s still a really good shot (8)</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The composition is perhaps a little too central; try cropping the image to one side, this would  in my opinion - improve the balance of the of the very strong background over the central subject. But that''s really only a small beef, and having said that, it''s still a really good shot (8)', '2002-09-12 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
