(117476, 5337, 3313, '<td valign="top">So many lovely pictures in this challenge ! This one a bit different from the other sophisticated interior ones, but as lovely to look at. Good luck. 7</td>', 'So many lovely pictures in this challenge ! This one a bit different from the other sophisticated interior ones, but as lovely to look at. Good luck. 7', '2002-09-09 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
