(117479, 5337, 82, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a bit of James and the Giant Peach.  :)  Beautiful, almost pastel coloring on the apple itself.  To me, the one blade of grass distracts from the apple''s focus, but it''s not fatal.  Very nice shot!</td>', 'Reminds me a bit of James and the Giant Peach.  :)  Beautiful, almost pastel coloring on the apple itself.  To me, the one blade of grass distracts from the apple''s focus, but it''s not fatal.  Very nice shot!', '2002-09-13 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
