(117484, 5340, 3294, '<td valign="top">Photo appears a little distorted.. slightly rounded... as if shot with a fisheye lens.  Just slightly, but that''s prolly a product of the round shapes.  Wish I had a pear tree.</td>', 'Photo appears a little distorted.. slightly rounded... as if shot with a fisheye lens.  Just slightly, but that''s prolly a product of the round shapes.  Wish I had a pear tree.', '2002-09-10 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
