(117486, 5340, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus and lighting on this are great, but the colors seem a little dull to me.  Not sure how to fix that, cause pears aren''t generally known for their bright colors! :-)</td>', 'The focus and lighting on this are great, but the colors seem a little dull to me.  Not sure how to fix that, cause pears aren''t generally known for their bright colors! :-)', '2002-09-13 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
