(117626, 5355, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised you didn''t use color here.  A very unique arrangement...not sure why you put the strawberry in the hair.  Is it strawberry blonde?  Sure...I think I got it!  <br/>Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce</td>', 'I''m surprised you didn''t use color here.  A very unique arrangement...not sure why you put the strawberry in the hair.  Is it strawberry blonde?  Sure...I think I got it!  Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce', '2002-09-14 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
