(117648, 5356, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Focus looks great.  I would have preferred just a bit less shadow on the right side.  Meets the challenge in an imaginative way.  8</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Focus looks great.  I would have preferred just a bit less shadow on the right side.  Meets the challenge in an imaginative way.  8', '2002-09-12 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117649, 5356, 82, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this week.  I like the muted green below, and the whimsical spiral up top, along with its tonal range of greens, oranges, and yellows.  Beautifully lit, very playful photo.</td>', 'One of my favorites this week.  I like the muted green below, and the whimsical spiral up top, along with its tonal range of greens, oranges, and yellows.  Beautifully lit, very playful photo.', '2002-09-12 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117650, 5356, 3208, '<td valign="top">A little less space at the top would have, in my opinion, been better.  Also, perhaps too much glare / reflection near the middle of the photo.  But a good photo with excellent creativity - well done!</td>', 'A little less space at the top would have, in my opinion, been better.  Also, perhaps too much glare / reflection near the middle of the photo.  But a good photo with excellent creativity - well done!', '2002-09-12 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
