(117780, 5368, 2172, '<td valign="top">OK, at first I marked this as a 7, but I''m changing to 8.  At first glance, I thought, the coloring is so unreal-like....but now I''m thinking, why does it have to be real-like.  This has really great composition and excellent DOF.  It just really stands out.  The blue looks great with the soft green background....OK, Now I''ve changed it to a 9, but that''s it (..I know, I''m a pushover).  I like abstract.  This has that "look at me" quality...The berries just really stand out.  The larger one on the bottom left, seems to almost be floating.  Excellent work  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'OK, at first I marked this as a 7, but I''m changing to 8.  At first glance, I thought, the coloring is so unreal-like....but now I''m thinking, why does it have to be real-like.  This has really great composition and excellent DOF.  It just really stands out.  The blue looks great with the soft green background....OK, Now I''ve changed it to a 9, but that''s it (..I know, I''m a pushover).  I like abstract.  This has that "look at me" quality...The berries just really stand out.  The larger one on the bottom left, seems to almost be floating.  Excellent work  9Ruthann', '2002-09-11 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
