(117788, 5368, 312, '<td valign="top">this is really nice. the color of those berries is mesmerizing. great depth of field and positioning. for some reason, it doesn''t quite grab me as much as some of my other favorites this week, but it''s right up there with them. i think i tend to lean toward the more arty shots in general, which is why this more natural shot doesn''t grab me as much. but i still really like it. good work.</td>', 'this is really nice. the color of those berries is mesmerizing. great depth of field and positioning. for some reason, it doesn''t quite grab me as much as some of my other favorites this week, but it''s right up there with them. i think i tend to lean toward the more arty shots in general, which is why this more natural shot doesn''t grab me as much. but i still really like it. good work.', '2002-09-13 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
