(117800, 5368, 737, '<td valign="top">This was a fun picture to get - I''m glad so many people liked it. First, I had to battle the bugs. Second, there were only a few minutes per day when the sunlight was hitting the berries. Otherwise, they were in deep shade.  I shot over 3 days, this one occurring on the 3rd day.</td>', 'This was a fun picture to get - I''m glad so many people liked it. First, I had to battle the bugs. Second, there were only a few minutes per day when the sunlight was hitting the berries. Otherwise, they were in deep shade.  I shot over 3 days, this one occurring on the 3rd day.', '2002-09-16 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
