(117822, 5372, 3506, '<td valign="top">The fruit was washed, cut and shot.  No oil, glaze, etc was used.  The lighting was an overhead lamp with three bulbs in it. As far as sharpening, I only resized the image and used a 0.5 unsharp mask in PhotoShop, so it doesn''t really have all that much sharpening.</td>', 'The fruit was washed, cut and shot.  No oil, glaze, etc was used.  The lighting was an overhead lamp with three bulbs in it. As far as sharpening, I only resized the image and used a 0.5 unsharp mask in PhotoShop, so it doesn''t really have all that much sharpening.', '2002-09-16 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
