(117865, 5375, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice color combination.  and two of my favorite fruits, yummy!  :)  the kiwi looks great, nice sharp focus, i really wish the strawberry was in focus, too.  i''m assuming that''s due to the limited DOF on macro shots?  just another nitpicky thing, there''s hairs from the kiwi in the lower left that are a little distracting. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'nice color combination.  and two of my favorite fruits, yummy!  :)  the kiwi looks great, nice sharp focus, i really wish the strawberry was in focus, too.  i''m assuming that''s due to the limited DOF on macro shots?  just another nitpicky thing, there''s hairs from the kiwi in the lower left that are a little distracting. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-10 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
