(117894, 5377, 2928, '<td valign="top">Heartburn; it''s not my heart I''d be worrying about burning :o)  This has been an exceptionally high quality challenge, and as I look again at your shot, I am thinking I have to go high again.  Exceptionally good use of colour and background, great contrasting shadows, inventive composition, well lit - but it''s the use of silver that shifts this shot up a notch!  Up there with the best Good luck, even with a 10 from me it''s still going to be hard contest to win</td>', 'Heartburn; it''s not my heart I''d be worrying about burning :o)  This has been an exceptionally high quality challenge, and as I look again at your shot, I am thinking I have to go high again.  Exceptionally good use of colour and background, great contrasting shadows, inventive composition, well lit - but it''s the use of silver that shifts this shot up a notch!  Up there with the best Good luck, even with a 10 from me it''s still going to be hard contest to win', '2002-09-10 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
