(117898, 5377, 3741, '<td valign="top">it''s interesting.....</td>', 'it''s interesting.....', '2002-09-10 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117899, 5377, 3213, '<td valign="top">Wow, it took you some time creating the composition. Colors are great;  the idea of the yellow pepper inside the red one is cool.</td>', 'Wow, it took you some time creating the composition. Colors are great;  the idea of the yellow pepper inside the red one is cool.', '2002-09-10 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117900, 5377, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although seems a little dark.</td>', 'Nice composition, although seems a little dark.', '2002-09-10 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117901, 5377, 1827, '<td valign="top">The 1st annual Miss Pepper contest -- the bright star on the pedestal.  The strip that goes up is what creates interest in this photo for me.  It could be the sash on the Miss America of Peppers.  All the other little peppers just crowd ''round wanting to be a part of the action.  The pepper seeds work nicely as confetti.  This photo evokes a feeling of celebration in me.  I like it.  The composition is very nice.  The title doesn''t really work for the feelings the photo evoked in me.  I understand the reference of course, but the photo seemed more one of celebration to me.  7, just-married</td>', 'The 1st annual Miss Pepper contest -- the bright star on the pedestal.  The strip that goes up is what creates interest in this photo for me.  It could be the sash on the Miss America of Peppers.  All the other little peppers just crowd ''round wanting to be a part of the action.  The pepper seeds work nicely as confetti.  This photo evokes a feeling of celebration in me.  I like it.  The composition is very nice.  The title doesn''t really work for the feelings the photo evoked in me.  I understand the reference of course, but the photo seemed more one of celebration to me.  7, just-married', '2002-09-10 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117902, 5377, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice vivid colors, wonderful subjects,  festive mood, well exposed.  In other words "Great job!"  Makes me wanna celebrate...."Celebrate good times c''mon"    Now ya got me singing...lol    You should do very well with this image.  Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Very nice vivid colors, wonderful subjects,  festive mood, well exposed.  In other words "Great job!"  Makes me wanna celebrate...."Celebrate good times c''mon"    Now ya got me singing...lol    You should do very well with this image.  Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-09-10 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
