(117911, 5377, 772, '<td valign="top">I like those little orange ones on the bottom :)  I have a small garden beside my condo where i cultivate a few assorted hot pepper plants each summer... I grow a few of the golden habaneros, serrano, and cayenne...  the assorted and random seeds in this image give me the impression of a firecracker going off... good shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like those little orange ones on the bottom :)  I have a small garden beside my condo where i cultivate a few assorted hot pepper plants each summer... I grow a few of the golden habaneros, serrano, and cayenne...  the assorted and random seeds in this image give me the impression of a firecracker going off... good shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-13 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117912, 5377, 1759, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites for this challenge. The reds almost get lost in the low key background, but you manage to pull out enough color to please the eye. I might normally complain about the highlights, but they seem to draw my attention to the darker objects. Okay, the light could be just a bit softer, but even at that it isn''t excessively harsh. I really like the arrangement and the accouterments.</td>', 'One of my favorites for this challenge. The reds almost get lost in the low key background, but you manage to pull out enough color to please the eye. I might normally complain about the highlights, but they seem to draw my attention to the darker objects. Okay, the light could be just a bit softer, but even at that it isn''t excessively harsh. I really like the arrangement and the accouterments.', '2002-09-13 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117913, 5377, 616, '<td valign="top">My eyes say yes, but my stomach says no.</td>', 'My eyes say yes, but my stomach says no.', '2002-09-13 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
