(117925, 5378, 3080, '<td valign="top">A couple of things.. I wish that either more of the bowl were showing, or less.  I think that the dark rim in the front is almost distracting.  The colors of the fruit are very nice.  I might have prefered a more yellow banana, but this is fruit, not perfection. right?  The focus and clarity are nice.  Overall good photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'A couple of things.. I wish that either more of the bowl were showing, or less.  I think that the dark rim in the front is almost distracting.  The colors of the fruit are very nice.  I might have prefered a more yellow banana, but this is fruit, not perfection. right?  The focus and clarity are nice.  Overall good photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117926, 5378, 3178, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. But I think the bowl (?) edge forground detracts a bit. Good background. The old banana is kind of interesting, but doesn''t seem to fit with the apples, which are fresh. I like it, but it has a sort of disharmony that''s a little confusing. 6</td>', 'This is interesting. But I think the bowl (?) edge forground detracts a bit. Good background. The old banana is kind of interesting, but doesn''t seem to fit with the apples, which are fresh. I like it, but it has a sort of disharmony that''s a little confusing. 6', '2002-09-11 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117927, 5378, 2928, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you have used DOF in this shot; it works really well.  I also think you have achieved a really good balance of colour between the positive and negative areas and both the composition and camera angle work well.  Nice shot (8)</td>', 'I really like the way you have used DOF in this shot; it works really well.  I also think you have achieved a really good balance of colour between the positive and negative areas and both the composition and camera angle work well.  Nice shot (8)', '2002-09-11 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
