(117960, 5381, 616, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that shrooms are exactly a Fruit or Veggie. If my memory serves me right, I learned in my botany course that a shroom is an organism within itself.  Other than that I like this shot. Nice macro, it has lots of texture. A different DOF might have worked better, to get the whole shroom in focus.</td>', 'I don''t think that shrooms are exactly a Fruit or Veggie. If my memory serves me right, I learned in my botany course that a shroom is an organism within itself.  Other than that I like this shot. Nice macro, it has lots of texture. A different DOF might have worked better, to get the whole shroom in focus.', '2002-09-13 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
