(117974, 5382, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very cute, very creative. I do note some blown highlights, which indicates the need for a better diffused light source.</td>', 'Very cute, very creative. I do note some blown highlights, which indicates the need for a better diffused light source.', '2002-09-10 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117975, 5382, 1827, '<td valign="top">Concept is a good one.  Are you familiar with the line of children''s books that illustrates this way?  I think it''s called Play with Your Food.<br/><br/>In this case, I think the execution needs some tweaking.  The light is very bright, too harsh for me.  Then there''s the roaming eye.  LOL.  The eye closest to the left of the photo looks right at me, but I can''t see the pupil on the other eye and I get the impression that it''s looking the other way.  That takes away from the realistic portrayla of a face.  The edges on the mouth also seem a bit jagged.  Can''t tell if that''s JPG compression or actual cutting. +1 for creativity and obvious effort.  6, just-married</td>', 'Concept is a good one.  Are you familiar with the line of children''s books that illustrates this way?  I think it''s called Play with Your Food.In this case, I think the execution needs some tweaking.  The light is very bright, too harsh for me.  Then there''s the roaming eye.  LOL.  The eye closest to the left of the photo looks right at me, but I can''t see the pupil on the other eye and I get the impression that it''s looking the other way.  That takes away from the realistic portrayla of a face.  The edges on the mouth also seem a bit jagged.  Can''t tell if that''s JPG compression or actual cutting. +1 for creativity and obvious effort.  6, just-married', '2002-09-10 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
