(117988, 5383, 671, '<td valign="top">I like the umbrella effect.</td>', 'I like the umbrella effect.', '2002-09-10 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117989, 5383, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Excelent photo.  I love the patterns.  I think you might have some of the same problem I had with my photo though.  I had gotten a comment about shooting "upward" into the sky and having the whiteish glares from the sky.  I don''t think it''s distracting though.  I think it adds a nice touch coming through the leaves.  The focus and clarity are good.  Angle is excelent and the framing is also very good.  I like the patterns that the branches make.  Overall great photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'Wow.  Excelent photo.  I love the patterns.  I think you might have some of the same problem I had with my photo though.  I had gotten a comment about shooting "upward" into the sky and having the whiteish glares from the sky.  I don''t think it''s distracting though.  I think it adds a nice touch coming through the leaves.  The focus and clarity are good.  Angle is excelent and the framing is also very good.  I like the patterns that the branches make.  Overall great photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117990, 5383, 1041, '<td valign="top">great idea, exotic fruit on a tree.  except for you it''s probably not so exotic ;)  the diversity is one of the things i like about dpc.  the composition of your photo is also nice, i like how the leaf-stalks are fanning out to all sides of the photo.  ROT works well here.  i''d love to see just a little more contrast, and a blue sky would be cool, but that part is kinda hard to control, i know. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'great idea, exotic fruit on a tree.  except for you it''s probably not so exotic ;)  the diversity is one of the things i like about dpc.  the composition of your photo is also nice, i like how the leaf-stalks are fanning out to all sides of the photo.  ROT works well here.  i''d love to see just a little more contrast, and a blue sky would be cool, but that part is kinda hard to control, i know. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-09-11 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117991, 5383, 2667, '<td valign="top">I love the radial symmetry with the globes interspersed, the background of interlaced foliage, and the rough textured folds of the trunk. Would have prefered sharper focus though. (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'I love the radial symmetry with the globes interspersed, the background of interlaced foliage, and the rough textured folds of the trunk. Would have prefered sharper focus though. (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-11 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(117992, 5383, 1066, '<td valign="top">The abstract quality of this shot is excellent..Yo useem to be let downby the quality of the camera as there seems to be a lot of noise in the shot and the color saturation is pretty bad...nevertheless....great composition..8..hokie</td>', 'The abstract quality of this shot is excellent..Yo useem to be let downby the quality of the camera as there seems to be a lot of noise in the shot and the color saturation is pretty bad...nevertheless....great composition..8..hokie', '2002-09-11 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
