(118111, 5394, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness but just want a tiny tiny bit more light. Not enough to light the whole apple which would make it too boring but as it stands it''s just too dark and undefined for me.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I like the darkness but just want a tiny tiny bit more light. Not enough to light the whole apple which would make it too boring but as it stands it''s just too dark and undefined for me.Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118112, 5394, 312, '<td valign="top">nice attempt, but it''s just too dark. and the label is the main focus, which isn''t very interesting. i''m also not a big fan of "negative space" style shots that place the subject near the top. it makes me feel like the top of the picture is missing, since the subject is "pointing" up, not down. (this placement works when the subject seems to be pointing down).  a good effort, but definitely needs more light.</td>', 'nice attempt, but it''s just too dark. and the label is the main focus, which isn''t very interesting. i''m also not a big fan of "negative space" style shots that place the subject near the top. it makes me feel like the top of the picture is missing, since the subject is "pointing" up, not down. (this placement works when the subject seems to be pointing down).  a good effort, but definitely needs more light.', '2002-09-13 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
