(118170, 5397, 1877, '<td valign="top">This really stands out.. I like the purple color "shooting" up from between the mirrored bananas. It''s very different from the rest of the "bunch" (hah) we have to look at.. i like it! Tidbits that do bother me.. I would have straightened it since it should be balanced completely. There is a slight blur that bothers me, but I''m assuming that this is due to the mirrors. Maybe for fun, play with the colors to make the bananas more yellow? Overall, 8! Jenguin</td>', 'This really stands out.. I like the purple color "shooting" up from between the mirrored bananas. It''s very different from the rest of the "bunch" (hah) we have to look at.. i like it! Tidbits that do bother me.. I would have straightened it since it should be balanced completely. There is a slight blur that bothers me, but I''m assuming that this is due to the mirrors. Maybe for fun, play with the colors to make the bananas more yellow? Overall, 8! Jenguin', '2002-09-10 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
