(118194, 5397, 2199, '<td valign="top">Very striking composition -- really catches the eye. I like this very much. The entire image has a sense of movement, so I might like this more if some part of the image were more tightly in focus (providing a place for the eye to rest). The column that shoots out of the top of the frame pulls my eye out of the photo, and the bananas don''t provide a nice place to settle my eye (due to the slight blur). LanSnake</td>', 'Very striking composition -- really catches the eye. I like this very much. The entire image has a sense of movement, so I might like this more if some part of the image were more tightly in focus (providing a place for the eye to rest). The column that shoots out of the top of the frame pulls my eye out of the photo, and the bananas don''t provide a nice place to settle my eye (due to the slight blur). LanSnake', '2002-09-15 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
