(118207, 5398, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice concept.  I think you needed a stainless steel hook (silver) to show up better with your background.  Were you going for a gradiation of color in the slice itself?  The green is pronounced near the top and fades to all yellow at the bottom.  To me, this lowers it''s aestitic appeal.  Still, great shot.  9 Swash</td>', 'Really nice concept.  I think you needed a stainless steel hook (silver) to show up better with your background.  Were you going for a gradiation of color in the slice itself?  The green is pronounced near the top and fades to all yellow at the bottom.  To me, this lowers it''s aestitic appeal.  Still, great shot.  9 Swash', '2002-09-10 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
