(118217, 5398, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hook a little dark and fades a little too much into backrgound. I''d like to see it a little more. Perhaps using a silvery one instead of black might help it show up more (if you agree with me on that point, of course if you don''t and wanted it to fade into the background your choice is spot on;)<br/>Lovely light through the fruit.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Hook a little dark and fades a little too much into backrgound. I''d like to see it a little more. Perhaps using a silvery one instead of black might help it show up more (if you agree with me on that point, of course if you don''t and wanted it to fade into the background your choice is spot on;)Lovely light through the fruit.8, Kavey', '2002-09-13 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
