(118225, 5399, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good composition, color, and focus. I think that the lighting is a bit uneven and thus the weakness of the image. Just a bit too hot on the right side, and too weak on the left. I think some fill light is needed for this type of shot.</td>', 'Good composition, color, and focus. I think that the lighting is a bit uneven and thus the weakness of the image. Just a bit too hot on the right side, and too weak on the left. I think some fill light is needed for this type of shot.', '2002-09-10 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118226, 5399, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and a very good shot.  But I feel that it could be improved  if only slightly  by changing the lighting.  Try using bounced flash or reflectors to kill the dark shadows within the palm  your central subject. The composition is perhaps a little too central as well; try cropping the image to one side, this would  in my opinion - improve the balance of the of the very strong background over the central subject. Having said that, it''s not a bad shot (7)</td>', 'This is a great idea and a very good shot.  But I feel that it could be improved  if only slightly  by changing the lighting.  Try using bounced flash or reflectors to kill the dark shadows within the palm  your central subject. The composition is perhaps a little too central as well; try cropping the image to one side, this would  in my opinion - improve the balance of the of the very strong background over the central subject. Having said that, it''s not a bad shot (7)', '2002-09-12 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
