(118258, 5400, 82, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  An explosion of Kiwi ... the color, though usually not appealing to me, is exciting here because it''s all natural.  Nice tonal range (almost a duotone of green and yellow), and the seeds are dynamite.  This says to me "organic," from the association between sperm-competing-for-ovum and fruit-as-tree''s-ovum, but also "cosmic," because of the blast of light.  It all ties together.  Very nice!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  An explosion of Kiwi ... the color, though usually not appealing to me, is exciting here because it''s all natural.  Nice tonal range (almost a duotone of green and yellow), and the seeds are dynamite.  This says to me "organic," from the association between sperm-competing-for-ovum and fruit-as-tree''s-ovum, but also "cosmic," because of the blast of light.  It all ties together.  Very nice!', '2002-09-12 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118259, 5400, 2223, '<td valign="top">the best kiwi pic of the kiwi pics! beautiful colors and focus. 8--shutterfly</td>', 'the best kiwi pic of the kiwi pics! beautiful colors and focus. 8--shutterfly', '2002-09-12 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
