(118262, 5400, 312, '<td valign="top">a very nice abstract. very nicely lit. my only gripe would be to try to get a slightly tighter crop, so you get rid of the 3 corners of the photo which clearly show the edge of the fruit. it detracts a bit from the overall feeling of the shot. i wouldn''t worry too much about cutting off some of the tops of the seeds. good work.</td>', 'a very nice abstract. very nicely lit. my only gripe would be to try to get a slightly tighter crop, so you get rid of the 3 corners of the photo which clearly show the edge of the fruit. it detracts a bit from the overall feeling of the shot. i wouldn''t worry too much about cutting off some of the tops of the seeds. good work.', '2002-09-13 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
