(118267, 5400, 3178, '<td valign="top">Nice job. The lighting along with your crop selection make this look especially interesting. It looks almost geographic, like the great barrier reef around australia shot from space. 7.</td>', 'Nice job. The lighting along with your crop selection make this look especially interesting. It looks almost geographic, like the great barrier reef around australia shot from space. 7.', '2002-09-14 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
