(118276, 5400, 3208, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, simple but effective.  Kind of reminds me of science fiction films, warping through space at lightning speed.  The colour / lighting makes the photo very clear, allowing me to search for minute details.  This makes the photo even more fascinating.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellent shot, simple but effective.  Kind of reminds me of science fiction films, warping through space at lightning speed.  The colour / lighting makes the photo very clear, allowing me to search for minute details.  This makes the photo even more fascinating.  Well done.', '2002-09-15 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118277, 5400, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent. like an exploding star!  a little grain and the color ijs sort of yellow but i love it! mag99</td>', 'excellent. like an exploding star!  a little grain and the color ijs sort of yellow but i love it! mag99', '2002-09-15 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
