(118299, 5401, 1143, '<td valign="top">Little confused about the right bottom of this pic. What''s going on there? I like the water on the fruit. Left side seems a little too dark maybe. ~indigo997</td>', 'Little confused about the right bottom of this pic. What''s going on there? I like the water on the fruit. Left side seems a little too dark maybe. ~indigo997', '2002-09-11 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
