(118451, 5413, 1827, '<td valign="top">What beautiful eyes your model has.  And what a strange photo.  It appeals to me though.  A bit of Magritte in it -- don''t know if that was intentional.  Funny that two people should have Magritte like images.   Anyway, 6-7, I''ll decide as the week passes.  just-married</td>', 'What beautiful eyes your model has.  And what a strange photo.  It appeals to me though.  A bit of Magritte in it -- don''t know if that was intentional.  Funny that two people should have Magritte like images.   Anyway, 6-7, I''ll decide as the week passes.  just-married', '2002-09-11 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
