(118509, 5415, 3669, '<td valign="top">Believe you me...last place means you can''t go any further down.  I''m only going to get better...I promise.  I am learning a lot about my cheap camera and am having better luck in getting photos to come out crisper.  This one was taken inside where I found that lighting is very important in getting a good digital shot.  I''ve gone outside with all my others.</td>', 'Believe you me...last place means you can''t go any further down.  I''m only going to get better...I promise.  I am learning a lot about my cheap camera and am having better luck in getting photos to come out crisper.  This one was taken inside where I found that lighting is very important in getting a good digital shot.  I''ve gone outside with all my others.', '2002-09-16 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
