(118609, 5421, 3294, '<td valign="top">Soeone told me once that when pouring wine from a bottle, the bottle should never touch the glass.  Yours touch the glass, I give you a 1.  Just kidding!  hehe  Now I''m thirstt for a smoothie, thank you very much!</td>', 'Soeone told me once that when pouring wine from a bottle, the bottle should never touch the glass.  Yours touch the glass, I give you a 1.  Just kidding!  hehe  Now I''m thirstt for a smoothie, thank you very much!', '2002-09-10 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118610, 5421, 2553, '<td valign="top">Makes me want some Boones Farm Strawberry Hill.  I love this shot except for one small thing.  I don''t care for the stem of the glass being "cut off".  I realize that you couldn''t get such a great close shot and leave it in, but it still bugs me.  Color, lighting, and execution of the idea are all wonderful.  lhall-8</td>', 'Makes me want some Boones Farm Strawberry Hill.  I love this shot except for one small thing.  I don''t care for the stem of the glass being "cut off".  I realize that you couldn''t get such a great close shot and leave it in, but it still bugs me.  Color, lighting, and execution of the idea are all wonderful.  lhall-8', '2002-09-10 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118611, 5421, 3372, '<td valign="top">This is a really creative photo.  Creativity separates the great from the good and good from the ok.   I wonder if the photo might be a little better if the background were more white.  It has a pinkish cast to it.  I think the whiter background would intensify the red of the wine and strawberries.  There is also a reflection on the left side of the wineglass which looks like a window with blinds.  This may have been your intent but I think it may be a bit of a distraction.  This is really nice though and one of my favorites this week.</td>', 'This is a really creative photo.  Creativity separates the great from the good and good from the ok.   I wonder if the photo might be a little better if the background were more white.  It has a pinkish cast to it.  I think the whiter background would intensify the red of the wine and strawberries.  There is also a reflection on the left side of the wineglass which looks like a window with blinds.  This may have been your intent but I think it may be a bit of a distraction.  This is really nice though and one of my favorites this week.', '2002-09-10 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118612, 5421, 3112, '<td valign="top">I hope this was the first take, because I can see that it might have taken LOTS of shots to get it right.  Mostly a great photo, with the exception of the *slightly* distracting image of the venetian blinds on the left of the glass.</td>', 'I hope this was the first take, because I can see that it might have taken LOTS of shots to get it right.  Mostly a great photo, with the exception of the *slightly* distracting image of the venetian blinds on the left of the glass.', '2002-09-11 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118613, 5421, 258, '<td valign="top">the blind is distracting. good photo though</td>', 'the blind is distracting. good photo though', '2002-09-11 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118614, 5421, 2472, '<td valign="top">Perfectly elegant and tasteful image. Very well executed. Great job!</td>', 'Perfectly elegant and tasteful image. Very well executed. Great job!', '2002-09-11 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118615, 5421, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. I don?t care for the reflection on the left side of the bottom glass and I want to see the bottom of it. (perhaps a shorter style glass) Great color and clarity. ? 9 Gotcha</td>', 'This is very well done. I don?t care for the reflection on the left side of the bottom glass and I want to see the bottom of it. (perhaps a shorter style glass) Great color and clarity. ? 9 Gotcha', '2002-09-12 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
