(118617, 5421, 2244, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup.  Maybe slightly dark. 7</td>', 'Very nice setup.  Maybe slightly dark. 7', '2002-09-12 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118618, 5421, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much, I gave it a 7, and the comments I give will be quite nit-picky, so be warned.<br/><br/>Its a nice composition but you must take into account out-side of the frame aswell. I can see a blue grate shape reflected in the glass and I think it is quite distracting, and against the red feeling of the photo.<br/><br/>The main strawberry in this photo (at the front) is not fully ripened, and has a white are on the top. You were probably unaware of this while shooting, but a ripened strawberry would look nicer :)<br/><br/>Finally I think the "strawberry wine" is a little weak. I would have likes it to be more af a promanent red colour, rather than the watery solution shows here. Even if that is the actual wine you used, I feel it could have been tampered with to improve the photo.<br/><br/>Oh, one last thing, //www.neatimage.com/ is a great program for cleaning digital noise, of which I can see quite prominently in this photo, check it out :)</td>', 'I like this photo very much, I gave it a 7, and the comments I give will be quite nit-picky, so be warned.Its a nice composition but you must take into account out-side of the frame aswell. I can see a blue grate shape reflected in the glass and I think it is quite distracting, and against the red feeling of the photo.The main strawberry in this photo (at the front) is not fully ripened, and has a white are on the top. You were probably unaware of this while shooting, but a ripened strawberry would look nicer :)Finally I think the "strawberry wine" is a little weak. I would have likes it to be more af a promanent red colour, rather than the watery solution shows here. Even if that is the actual wine you used, I feel it could have been tampered with to improve the photo.Oh, one last thing, //www.neatimage.com/ is a great program for cleaning digital noise, of which I can see quite prominently in this photo, check it out :)', '2002-09-12 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118619, 5421, 3039, '<td valign="top">Incredible Photo - Perfect</td>', 'Incredible Photo - Perfect', '2002-09-12 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118620, 5421, 772, '<td valign="top">compositionally, i love this photo... i love RED... you have done a very nice job of capturing the red in this image.... my critique is only on the background.  I think that a lighter color background, like white possibly, would have created a beautiful contrast between the reds :)  good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'compositionally, i love this photo... i love RED... you have done a very nice job of capturing the red in this image.... my critique is only on the background.  I think that a lighter color background, like white possibly, would have created a beautiful contrast between the reds :)  good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-13 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118621, 5421, 3087, '<td valign="top">7, Kavey</td>', '7, Kavey', '2002-09-13 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118622, 5421, 2667, '<td valign="top">would have liked to have seen nothing but red liquid pouring from above into the fruit-filled glass (maybe a dark green wine bottle to accentuate your fruit caps) would have made for a stronger image compositionally, i think. distracted by reflection on  upper left of bottom glass...  but I do like the graded tone in the background, though. Good shot. (6)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'would have liked to have seen nothing but red liquid pouring from above into the fruit-filled glass (maybe a dark green wine bottle to accentuate your fruit caps) would have made for a stronger image compositionally, i think. distracted by reflection on  upper left of bottom glass...  but I do like the graded tone in the background, though. Good shot. (6)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-13 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118623, 5421, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  The reds really stand out.  My only nit (and it is VERY minor) is the background color.  I think a pure white or something would have really made this picture zing! karmat</td>', 'Excellent idea.  The reds really stand out.  My only nit (and it is VERY minor) is the background color.  I think a pure white or something would have really made this picture zing! karmat', '2002-09-13 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
