(118693, 5431, 671, '<td valign="top">good still life composition</td>', 'good still life composition', '2002-09-10 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118694, 5431, 2764, '<td valign="top">Way to many inrelated elements (sorry, if this is a collection of some religious ceremonial significance)ad they crowd the boarders.  Lose the sea shell, he doesn''t belong and he;s too bright, leave the brightness off the the candle/  Try to make it look like the really is candle is the only light source which means fix the lighting on that nut or fig.  ANd give the sculpture things room to breathe at the top.  It doesn''t contribute to the composition to have them  cut off.</td>', 'Way to many inrelated elements (sorry, if this is a collection of some religious ceremonial significance)ad they crowd the boarders.  Lose the sea shell, he doesn''t belong and he;s too bright, leave the brightness off the the candle/  Try to make it look like the really is candle is the only light source which means fix the lighting on that nut or fig.  ANd give the sculpture things room to breathe at the top.  It doesn''t contribute to the composition to have them  cut off.', '2002-09-10 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
