(118697, 5431, 3616, '<td valign="top">Cropped the top of the object on the left, that bothered me.  Lighting is moody, but why?<br/><br/>Good shot over all.  6</td>', 'Cropped the top of the object on the left, that bothered me.  Lighting is moody, but why?Good shot over all.  6', '2002-09-11 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
