(118719, 5434, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would be submitting this photo for the negative space challenge too...maybe just substitute the fruit for something else.  You can never go wrong with naked women, IMO.<br/></td>', 'I would be submitting this photo for the negative space challenge too...maybe just substitute the fruit for something else.  You can never go wrong with naked women, IMO.', '2002-09-09 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118720, 5434, 3313, '<td valign="top">OK, I think it''s a fantastic shot. The lighting is really perfect (IMHO) and the colours are great. I''d like to have more information on the subject: what kind of apple is it ?</td>', 'OK, I think it''s a fantastic shot. The lighting is really perfect (IMHO) and the colours are great. I''d like to have more information on the subject: what kind of apple is it ?', '2002-09-09 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
