(118723, 5434, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good skin tone!  This is lovely.  Coyly arousing.  10 Swash<br/>(Great nude w/o being "dirty"!)  Cute thought (from somebody else''s photo:  peel an "extra" apple and have the peeling draped across the body, very appealing!)</td>', 'Very good skin tone!  This is lovely.  Coyly arousing.  10 Swash(Great nude w/o being "dirty"!)  Cute thought (from somebody else''s photo:  peel an "extra" apple and have the peeling draped across the body, very appealing!)', '2002-09-09 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118724, 5434, 1856, '<td valign="top">great composition and lighting...love the shadow in the arch of her back...tastefully done...9 Lisa<br/></td>', 'great composition and lighting...love the shadow in the arch of her back...tastefully done...9 Lisa', '2002-09-09 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118725, 5434, 1189, '<td valign="top">nice, love the extra redness in the apple</td>', 'nice, love the extra redness in the apple', '2002-09-09 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118726, 5434, 3102, '<td valign="top">It would sure be interesting to see the tally of votes on this one split among gender lines!  As a member of the testosterone-crazed male species, I have no choice but to rate this one very highly.<br/><br/>But seriously, I really like this shot.  The skin tone is great, and it''s so sharp you can almost see individual pores.  The lighting on the apple is super, with the highlighted area completely intact and not washed out at all.  It looks like you spent a good bit of time choosing just the right apple for this, too.  And finally, it all looks great against the black background -- that choice does great justice to the subject.</td>', 'It would sure be interesting to see the tally of votes on this one split among gender lines!  As a member of the testosterone-crazed male species, I have no choice but to rate this one very highly.But seriously, I really like this shot.  The skin tone is great, and it''s so sharp you can almost see individual pores.  The lighting on the apple is super, with the highlighted area completely intact and not washed out at all.  It looks like you spent a good bit of time choosing just the right apple for this, too.  And finally, it all looks great against the black background -- that choice does great justice to the subject.', '2002-09-09 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118727, 5434, 2881, '<td valign="top">Wow, nudes are not usually my favorites, but this is great. Goes way beyond just trying to win by showing skin!</td>', 'Wow, nudes are not usually my favorites, but this is great. Goes way beyond just trying to win by showing skin!', '2002-09-09 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118728, 5434, 3354, '<td valign="top">Why I like this image: 1. The Statement 2. Nice Lighting 3. Clever cropping (leaves you wondering.  I''m giving you a 10. Btw. you are certainly lucky to work with such beautifull models!  - phlebotiss</td>', 'Why I like this image: 1. The Statement 2. Nice Lighting 3. Clever cropping (leaves you wondering.  I''m giving you a 10. Btw. you are certainly lucky to work with such beautifull models!  - phlebotiss', '2002-09-09 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
