(118730, 5434, 2612, '<td valign="top">Seems like something you would see in a poster store, but I still like it. The simple lines of the female form and the way the enter the frame is good. I also like the contrast between the background, the skin and the apple. Nice composition.</td>', 'Seems like something you would see in a poster store, but I still like it. The simple lines of the female form and the way the enter the frame is good. I also like the contrast between the background, the skin and the apple. Nice composition.', '2002-09-09 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118731, 5434, 2472, '<td valign="top">I have to like this picture, since I had a very similar idea, although I was planning on another position for the body, Excellent choice of fruit, and great execution of the design. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'I have to like this picture, since I had a very similar idea, although I was planning on another position for the body, Excellent choice of fruit, and great execution of the design. Wonderful shot.', '2002-09-10 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118732, 5434, 3672, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8, This is simple and tells a story. Good job!</td>', 'I gave this an 8, This is simple and tells a story. Good job!', '2002-09-10 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
