(118761, 5434, 82, '<td valign="top">You are sure to get comments (and compliments!) on this one.  Your model is beautiful ... nice tonal range on her skin, terrific curves, very nicely balanced lights and darks, good use of negative space.  The apple is witty, for all its Eve connotations (lust, forbidden knowledge) and for its color.  I could honestly gawk at this photo all day long.  This is teetering between a 9 and 10 for me ... if it misses the 10, it''s because 10 means perfect -- and to be super picky, there are a few teensy blemishes on the closer thigh, easily spot edited after the challenge.</td>', 'You are sure to get comments (and compliments!) on this one.  Your model is beautiful ... nice tonal range on her skin, terrific curves, very nicely balanced lights and darks, good use of negative space.  The apple is witty, for all its Eve connotations (lust, forbidden knowledge) and for its color.  I could honestly gawk at this photo all day long.  This is teetering between a 9 and 10 for me ... if it misses the 10, it''s because 10 means perfect -- and to be super picky, there are a few teensy blemishes on the closer thigh, easily spot edited after the challenge.', '2002-09-12 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
