(118767, 5434, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful - first thing I thought was of Eve and the temptation of the apple and the whole forbidden fruit thing. (Which I am sure was your intention).<br/>But with the lovely expanse of smooth (and I''m very envious to say, cellulite-free) thigh at the right, I kind of want more weight at the left, bosoms rather than rib cage. No insult to owner of lush body intended :)<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'This is beautiful - first thing I thought was of Eve and the temptation of the apple and the whole forbidden fruit thing. (Which I am sure was your intention).But with the lovely expanse of smooth (and I''m very envious to say, cellulite-free) thigh at the right, I kind of want more weight at the left, bosoms rather than rib cage. No insult to owner of lush body intended :)8, Kavey', '2002-09-13 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118768, 5434, 2780, '<td valign="top">I feel awkward voting on this because people might think that i like it because of the nakedness, but to be truthful it is a fantastic photo (and the model ain''t half bad either :P  ). The curves from her pose blend in so well with the apple, and her pink pastel skin is great contrast to the black background and the vibrant red apple! Great photo, and best of luck in the challenge! 10 -- Konador</td>', 'I feel awkward voting on this because people might think that i like it because of the nakedness, but to be truthful it is a fantastic photo (and the model ain''t half bad either :P  ). The curves from her pose blend in so well with the apple, and her pink pastel skin is great contrast to the black background and the vibrant red apple! Great photo, and best of luck in the challenge! 10 -- Konador', '2002-09-13 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(118769, 5434, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a pretty good shot, john. honestly, i don''t find the crop to be all that interesting. i feel like i''d rather see more of the legs and the curves that those would present. i also like the edit you posted on photosig with the black and white body and the red apple. overall, a decent shot. i think you could expand on this subject more. as always, it''s very well lit. good work. - mci</td>', 'this is a pretty good shot, john. honestly, i don''t find the crop to be all that interesting. i feel like i''d rather see more of the legs and the curves that those would present. i also like the edit you posted on photosig with the black and white body and the red apple. overall, a decent shot. i think you could expand on this subject more. as always, it''s very well lit. good work. - mci', '2002-09-13 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
