(118907, 5442, 1280, '<td valign="top">Geeeee....Quite clever!  Good use of color, although, I''d like a different background color...black would really make it snap.  Very good anyway. Congratulations!<br/><br/> Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce...aka...Gracious<br/></td>', 'Geeeee....Quite clever!  Good use of color, although, I''d like a different background color...black would really make it snap.  Very good anyway. Congratulations! Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-09-10 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
