(118914, 5442, 2780, '<td valign="top">One of my fave shots this week. Altho this idea has been used in a few other shots I like this the best because it is simple, and the 2 totally opposite colours are great. Red and Yellow (and a blue background) all the primary colours, its awesome. I think it could look better if the banana skin was at a slightly different angle tho, so you can see all 3 peels without one being hidden, but I still vote this a big fat 10! - Konador</td>', 'One of my fave shots this week. Altho this idea has been used in a few other shots I like this the best because it is simple, and the 2 totally opposite colours are great. Red and Yellow (and a blue background) all the primary colours, its awesome. I think it could look better if the banana skin was at a slightly different angle tho, so you can see all 3 peels without one being hidden, but I still vote this a big fat 10! - Konador', '2002-09-13 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
