(119002, 5448, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The background is busy, so makes this shot more interesting, but it isnt too distracting. That''s always a good thing :).<br/>I think to improve the photo you could ask your model to widen the eyes, and raise the eyebrows, to give a more scared look! Failing that, you could just put a normal apple on his head and then REALLY fire an arrow at him. That should get you a more scared looking expression.<br/>8<br/>Konador</td>', 'Very nice photo. The background is busy, so makes this shot more interesting, but it isnt too distracting. That''s always a good thing :).I think to improve the photo you could ask your model to widen the eyes, and raise the eyebrows, to give a more scared look! Failing that, you could just put a normal apple on his head and then REALLY fire an arrow at him. That should get you a more scared looking expression.8Konador', '2002-09-13 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119003, 5448, 1128, '<td valign="top">It''s great the way you only included the eyes.</td>', 'It''s great the way you only included the eyes.', '2002-09-14 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
