(119007, 5448, 2221, '<td valign="top">Funny Wilhelm Tell reference. I like the title :-) I also like the crop and that the face of the child is not fully seen. The eyes are important but it keeps a good balance so that the focus is not primarily on the kids face but on the apple/arrow. Good contrast of the red apple vs. the green background. -stephan</td>', 'Funny Wilhelm Tell reference. I like the title :-) I also like the crop and that the face of the child is not fully seen. The eyes are important but it keeps a good balance so that the focus is not primarily on the kids face but on the apple/arrow. Good contrast of the red apple vs. the green background. -stephan', '2002-09-14 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119008, 5448, 3178, '<td valign="top">This would have been more compelling had there been the blur of high speed motion in the arrow, or perhaps a small trail of blood from the kids forehead... heh heh...</td>', 'This would have been more compelling had there been the blur of high speed motion in the arrow, or perhaps a small trail of blood from the kids forehead... heh heh...', '2002-09-15 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
