(119094, 5453, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful design and colours. I love the reflection of the colour in the bowl and the cirlce of the edge is very bold --a great photo  andrewm</td>', 'Beautiful design and colours. I love the reflection of the colour in the bowl and the cirlce of the edge is very bold --a great photo  andrewm', '2002-09-13 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
