(119115, 5455, 748, '<td valign="top">Looks like you used flash, but a little more lighting on the potato would have been better.  I like the positive space! (He He)</td>', 'Looks like you used flash, but a little more lighting on the potato would have been better.  I like the positive space! (He He)', '2002-09-11 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
