(119121, 5455, 573, '<td valign="top">I like flame pictures and the colors you have captured are great.  In my opinion the fraiming/composition is too tight and might benifit from the rule of thirds.  One of my top ten picks this week.</td>', 'I like flame pictures and the colors you have captured are great.  In my opinion the fraiming/composition is too tight and might benifit from the rule of thirds.  One of my top ten picks this week.', '2002-09-12 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
