(119129, 5455, 472, '<td valign="top">i feel the fire imagery is very strong on this.  the potato itself might have benefited from some additional lighting so that it ''reads'' more clearly as what it is.  a flashlight perhaps.  also if it was either a little more to the right or left in the frame, it would be a stronger composition :) .. 7. mag99</td>', 'i feel the fire imagery is very strong on this.  the potato itself might have benefited from some additional lighting so that it ''reads'' more clearly as what it is.  a flashlight perhaps.  also if it was either a little more to the right or left in the frame, it would be a stronger composition :) .. 7. mag99', '2002-09-15 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119130, 5456, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-09 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119131, 5456, 3380, '<td valign="top">keeping it simple</td>', 'keeping it simple', '2002-09-09 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119132, 5456, 3810, '<td valign="top">Looks good</td>', 'Looks good', '2002-09-10 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119133, 5456, 2928, '<td valign="top">In terms of the shot in general, I can''t say there''s any real flaw.  But, perhaps the composition could be improved.  I think cropping the shot so the apple isn''t quite so central would help.  More importantly, the branch in the background that is invading the apple''s subject area is a big distraction. (5) Good luck, sorry to be so negative.</td>', 'In terms of the shot in general, I can''t say there''s any real flaw.  But, perhaps the composition could be improved.  I think cropping the shot so the apple isn''t quite so central would help.  More importantly, the branch in the background that is invading the apple''s subject area is a big distraction. (5) Good luck, sorry to be so negative.', '2002-09-10 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119134, 5456, 772, '<td valign="top">You did an excellent job of capturing your subject in this photo.. the clarity and depth of field are very nice :)  Personally, I would have composed this apple a little more off center (rule of thirds composition) to provide some more visual impact... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'You did an excellent job of capturing your subject in this photo.. the clarity and depth of field are very nice :)  Personally, I would have composed this apple a little more off center (rule of thirds composition) to provide some more visual impact... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-10 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119135, 5456, 1897, '<td valign="top">Technical:  Exposure/focus/composition - 7<br/>Style/originality - 7<br/>Overall 7<br/>The compostion is nice.</td>', 'Technical:  Exposure/focus/composition - 7Style/originality - 7Overall 7The compostion is nice.', '2002-09-10 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119136, 5456, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty good looking apple.  I like how the light green stands out on the dark green.  I wish that the white branch wasn''t in the background, but it doesn''t take away from the photo.  The clarity and focus are very good.  The angle and framing are good.  I wonder what kind of impact this would have if the apple were off set from the center of the photo?  Overall great job.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'Pretty good looking apple.  I like how the light green stands out on the dark green.  I wish that the white branch wasn''t in the background, but it doesn''t take away from the photo.  The clarity and focus are very good.  The angle and framing are good.  I wonder what kind of impact this would have if the apple were off set from the center of the photo?  Overall great job.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119137, 5456, 2667, '<td valign="top">i like this apple. great colors, good composition. (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'i like this apple. great colors, good composition. (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-11 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119138, 5456, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely done..</td>', 'nicely done..', '2002-09-11 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
