(119207, 5461, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the idea but for me the cup disappears too well into the background and therefore it''s hard to even realise it''s there. Since it''s presence is what explains the layout of the fruit I think it needs to be a little more obvious, not like smack me in the head obvious but just a little more defined. That''s just my opinion though and others will probably say that it''s the subtleness of the cup that makes this shot for them!<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Love the idea but for me the cup disappears too well into the background and therefore it''s hard to even realise it''s there. Since it''s presence is what explains the layout of the fruit I think it needs to be a little more obvious, not like smack me in the head obvious but just a little more defined. That''s just my opinion though and others will probably say that it''s the subtleness of the cup that makes this shot for them!6, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119208, 5461, 2344, '<td valign="top">Those strawberries look good, but the tops suggest to me that they aren''t very fresh as the greens are wilted and brown. Maybe selecting the "prettier" greens and have those ones face the camera. Otherwise looks alright 6-BigSmiles</td>', 'Those strawberries look good, but the tops suggest to me that they aren''t very fresh as the greens are wilted and brown. Maybe selecting the "prettier" greens and have those ones face the camera. Otherwise looks alright 6-BigSmiles', '2002-09-13 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
