(119211, 5461, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautifully done and you have challenged me. I don''t know what to say really, I love the all white background and cup that seems to be nothing but shadows. My top 5 - 9</td>', 'Wow, beautifully done and you have challenged me. I don''t know what to say really, I love the all white background and cup that seems to be nothing but shadows. My top 5 - 9', '2002-09-13 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
