(119224, 5463, 772, '<td valign="top">You have effectively captured the challenge by photographing this watermelon... In my opinion, the subject lacks punch or pizazz.  When I look at this photo, I say to myself, "Yep... that''s a watermelon."  I am looking for an eye-catching view... something that intrigues me... some part of the image that I can get lost in... When making photos for the challenges, keep in mind that visual impact plays an important role :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'You have effectively captured the challenge by photographing this watermelon... In my opinion, the subject lacks punch or pizazz.  When I look at this photo, I say to myself, "Yep... that''s a watermelon."  I am looking for an eye-catching view... something that intrigues me... some part of the image that I can get lost in... When making photos for the challenges, keep in mind that visual impact plays an important role :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-09 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119225, 5463, 3691, '<td valign="top">nice idea, off center a bit, a dash of color would be nice?</td>', 'nice idea, off center a bit, a dash of color would be nice?', '2002-09-09 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
