(119228, 5463, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice idea to keep the photo all in shades of green, melon''s make a great subject for this challenge.  i would''ve preferred some more even lighting, either put it all the way in the shade (probably better, no sun reflection) or all the way in the sun. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'nice idea to keep the photo all in shades of green, melon''s make a great subject for this challenge.  i would''ve preferred some more even lighting, either put it all the way in the shade (probably better, no sun reflection) or all the way in the sun. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-10 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119229, 5463, 3080, '<td valign="top">The light ON the watermellon is a little bright and the light around the mellon is a bit dark.  However, the focus and clarity are really great.  I think I would like to have seen some of the inside of this mellon too.  The angle and framing are good.  I like how the watermellon is not centered, but off center slightly.  Overall nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'The light ON the watermellon is a little bright and the light around the mellon is a bit dark.  However, the focus and clarity are really great.  I think I would like to have seen some of the inside of this mellon too.  The angle and framing are good.  I like how the watermellon is not centered, but off center slightly.  Overall nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
