(119243, 5464, 3178, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This is the best looking okra I''ve ever seen! Great job with the lighting from dark to light. Good detail on the veggie. 10 - chrisab</td>', 'Very nice. This is the best looking okra I''ve ever seen! Great job with the lighting from dark to light. Good detail on the veggie. 10 - chrisab', '2002-09-11 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119244, 5464, 133, '<td valign="top">Someone who had never seen okra before once asked me to describe it...my reply was "a fuzzy green bean", which doesn''t sound too appetizing. LOL.  I like the photograph, but perhaps could have shown one cut in two, they have a nice shape.</td>', 'Someone who had never seen okra before once asked me to describe it...my reply was "a fuzzy green bean", which doesn''t sound too appetizing. LOL.  I like the photograph, but perhaps could have shown one cut in two, they have a nice shape.', '2002-09-11 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119245, 5464, 1066, '<td valign="top">Simply and absolutely wonderful shot.  I work in advertising and I have done dozens of magazine food ads and this is what I want to see..Beautiful presentation, color..very painterly and perfect...10..hokie</td>', 'Simply and absolutely wonderful shot.  I work in advertising and I have done dozens of magazine food ads and this is what I want to see..Beautiful presentation, color..very painterly and perfect...10..hokie', '2002-09-11 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119246, 5464, 82, '<td valign="top">Great balance of space vs. negative space.  I like the stark GREEN.  The lighting is super, and the background color is right on in that it quietly supports the rest of the image.  Strong 9.</td>', 'Great balance of space vs. negative space.  I like the stark GREEN.  The lighting is super, and the background color is right on in that it quietly supports the rest of the image.  Strong 9.', '2002-09-12 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119247, 5464, 2223, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, little bright in the middle 7--shutterlfy</td>', 'interesting photo, little bright in the middle 7--shutterlfy', '2002-09-12 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119248, 5464, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective and interesting contrasts.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Unusual perspective and interesting contrasts.7, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119249, 5464, 312, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite shot this challenge. i love the perspective, the depth of field, the soft yet vibrant colors, and all that great looking negative space. just a great composition. one of the few 10s i give on this site.</td>', 'this is my favorite shot this challenge. i love the perspective, the depth of field, the soft yet vibrant colors, and all that great looking negative space. just a great composition. one of the few 10s i give on this site.', '2002-09-13 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119250, 5464, 3672, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF</td>', 'Nice use of DOF', '2002-09-13 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119251, 5464, 616, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I''m wondering if it may have worked out better with a different DOF.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I''m wondering if it may have worked out better with a different DOF.', '2002-09-13 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119252, 5464, 2437, '<td valign="top">DOF distroyed your pic.</td>', 'DOF distroyed your pic.', '2002-09-14 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119253, 5464, 1128, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and lighting!</td>', 'Great perspective and lighting!', '2002-09-14 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119254, 5464, 3903, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2002-09-14 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119255, 5464, 3589, '<td valign="top">great use of light and darknes..</td>', 'great use of light and darknes..', '2002-09-14 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119256, 5464, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-09-14 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119257, 5464, 656, '<td valign="top">good attempt at something more different than ''a pile of fruit and/or veg''<br/><br/><br/>Bit too dark at the bottom makes it overall feel heavy.<br/><br/>Gordon</td>', 'good attempt at something more different than ''a pile of fruit and/or veg''Bit too dark at the bottom makes it overall feel heavy.Gordon', '2002-09-15 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119258, 5464, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! It''s hard to say why. The vibrant colours, soft focus, and weird, alien shapes, as well as the contrast between the green areas and the darkness in the lower part of the photo. It''s all very appealing to me. One of my 10s - lisae</td>', 'I love this photo! It''s hard to say why. The vibrant colours, soft focus, and weird, alien shapes, as well as the contrast between the green areas and the darkness in the lower part of the photo. It''s all very appealing to me. One of my 10s - lisae', '2002-09-15 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119259, 5464, 3178, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is the most underrated photo of the week. This got one of my 2 10s. I think it''s original and well done - great texture, great shapes, good lighting, etc etc. Maybe people just don''t know what okra is.</td>', 'In my opinion, this is the most underrated photo of the week. This got one of my 2 10s. I think it''s original and well done - great texture, great shapes, good lighting, etc etc. Maybe people just don''t know what okra is.', '2002-09-16 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(119260, 5466, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting.  I think I''ve had my fill of "pear" titles this week though!!</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting.  I think I''ve had my fill of "pear" titles this week though!!', '2002-09-09 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119261, 5466, 772, '<td valign="top">You have effectively captured the challenge by photographing these pears... In my opinion, the subject lacks punch or pizazz.  When I look at this photo, I say to myself, "Yep... those are pears."  I am looking for an eye-catching view... something that intrigues me... some part of the image that I can get lost in... When making photos for the challenges, keep in mind that visual impact plays an important role :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'You have effectively captured the challenge by photographing these pears... In my opinion, the subject lacks punch or pizazz.  When I look at this photo, I say to myself, "Yep... those are pears."  I am looking for an eye-catching view... something that intrigues me... some part of the image that I can get lost in... When making photos for the challenges, keep in mind that visual impact plays an important role :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-09 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119262, 5466, 671, '<td valign="top">lighting glare is distracting.</td>', 'lighting glare is distracting.', '2002-09-10 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119263, 5466, 1280, '<td valign="top">background is distracting...but nice anyway!</td>', 'background is distracting...but nice anyway!', '2002-09-10 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119264, 5466, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/>I know you could have manuvered to a point that the power lines would have been out of view.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   AutoolI know you could have manuvered to a point that the power lines would have been out of view.', '2002-09-11 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119265, 5467, 806, '<td valign="top">Very dark.</td>', 'Very dark.', '2002-09-09 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119266, 5467, 2361, '<td valign="top">A little TOO dark for my taste, but a well-composed image.  7 Jak</td>', 'A little TOO dark for my taste, but a well-composed image.  7 Jak', '2002-09-09 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119267, 5467, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection, but I think it needs a touch more light to show some of the details better. karmat</td>', 'I really like the reflection, but I think it needs a touch more light to show some of the details better. karmat', '2002-09-09 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119268, 5467, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This is fine art.</td>', 'Very nice. This is fine art.', '2002-09-09 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119269, 5467, 1189, '<td valign="top">cool, I would like to see it a little brighter. good one though</td>', 'cool, I would like to see it a little brighter. good one though', '2002-09-09 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119270, 5467, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-09-09 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119271, 5467, 3323, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me.</td>', 'Too dark for me.', '2002-09-09 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119272, 5467, 2472, '<td valign="top">This has a very good and tasteful composition design, but I find the light and colors to be dull. The hardest challenge for this type of shot I have found it to be the focus on the reflected image on the mirror.</td>', 'This has a very good and tasteful composition design, but I find the light and colors to be dull. The hardest challenge for this type of shot I have found it to be the focus on the reflected image on the mirror.', '2002-09-09 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119273, 5467, 3380, '<td valign="top">could use more lighting</td>', 'could use more lighting', '2002-09-09 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119274, 5467, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great use of colour.  It''s just a tad on the dark side, but I think that adds a little atmosphere. Great use of a reflective surface (8)</td>', 'Great shot, great use of colour.  It''s just a tad on the dark side, but I think that adds a little atmosphere. Great use of a reflective surface (8)', '2002-09-10 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119275, 5467, 3328, '<td valign="top">Too dark!</td>', 'Too dark!', '2002-09-10 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119276, 5467, 2560, '<td valign="top">this just needs a little more light.  8  Niten</td>', 'this just needs a little more light.  8  Niten', '2002-09-10 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119277, 5467, 3616, '<td valign="top">Is this blurry or am I tired?<br/><br/>6</td>', 'Is this blurry or am I tired?6', '2002-09-11 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119278, 5467, 3832, '<td valign="top">This has potential, but it is WAY too dark.</td>', 'This has potential, but it is WAY too dark.', '2002-09-11 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119279, 5467, 2172, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard a lot of this, but it''s too dark...if it was intentional, then for me, it doesn''t go with the subject or the title...Fruits-n-blooms (for me) dictates a colorful and vibrant pic.  Perhaps it was in error (and that never happens, right? - I''ve had my share) - beyond that...for me it still misses something...I still see just a banana, orange and 2 flowers.....OH, right now, I see the coloring connection - makes more sense - but still perhaps a different arrangement or something.  Just my opinion :-)   4<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard a lot of this, but it''s too dark...if it was intentional, then for me, it doesn''t go with the subject or the title...Fruits-n-blooms (for me) dictates a colorful and vibrant pic.  Perhaps it was in error (and that never happens, right? - I''ve had my share) - beyond that...for me it still misses something...I still see just a banana, orange and 2 flowers.....OH, right now, I see the coloring connection - makes more sense - but still perhaps a different arrangement or something.  Just my opinion :-)   4Ruthann', '2002-09-11 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119280, 5467, 1280, '<td valign="top">A little dark but pretty anyway....Good luck in the challenge. Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'A little dark but pretty anyway....Good luck in the challenge. Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-12 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119281, 5467, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, mabye just a bit more light?</td>', 'Nice composition, mabye just a bit more light?', '2002-09-12 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119282, 5467, 3208, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I just do not like those roses there.  They just seem out of place.  However, I think the reflection of the subjects is what makes this photo work, and overall I think this is a good photo.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I just do not like those roses there.  They just seem out of place.  However, I think the reflection of the subjects is what makes this photo work, and overall I think this is a good photo.', '2002-09-12 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119283, 5467, 2244, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life but too dark.</td>', 'Very nice still life but too dark.', '2002-09-12 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119284, 5467, 2223, '<td valign="top">nice photo..a little too dark</td>', 'nice photo..a little too dark', '2002-09-12 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119285, 5467, 3524, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this image. But the shadows are so light that it really flattens the picture. If you were to darken them about 10%, I think that would really help pop the fruit and flowers. --JPerez</td>', 'I like the composition on this image. But the shadows are so light that it really flattens the picture. If you were to darken them about 10%, I think that would really help pop the fruit and flowers. --JPerez', '2002-09-13 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119286, 5467, 2261, '<td valign="top">Too dark. The reflection is nice, as is the layout of the shot but too too dark!!! 4-Martin.</td>', 'Too dark. The reflection is nice, as is the layout of the shot but too too dark!!! 4-Martin.', '2002-09-13 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119287, 5467, 1897, '<td valign="top">great compositions, and arangement of colors, but it appears a little dark and flat.</td>', 'great compositions, and arangement of colors, but it appears a little dark and flat.', '2002-09-13 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119288, 5467, 1759, '<td valign="top">I think that I see what you are trying to accomplish here. It almost works, but seems to be lacking texture in regard to the lighting. The dark tones don''t bother me, but I believe light play is important to bring interest to such a low key image. A faint glow on or behind a subject or some such effect to draw attention to the main subject and bring some visual motion to the image.</td>', 'I think that I see what you are trying to accomplish here. It almost works, but seems to be lacking texture in regard to the lighting. The dark tones don''t bother me, but I believe light play is important to bring interest to such a low key image. A faint glow on or behind a subject or some such effect to draw attention to the main subject and bring some visual motion to the image.', '2002-09-13 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119289, 5467, 1005, '<td valign="top">Other than being dark, this is a really nice photo.  Focus is good/ framing is as well.  The double image on the mirror bothered me at first, but less so now.  Nice arrangement.  7 Swash</td>', 'Other than being dark, this is a really nice photo.  Focus is good/ framing is as well.  The double image on the mirror bothered me at first, but less so now.  Nice arrangement.  7 Swash', '2002-09-13 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119290, 5467, 3672, '<td valign="top">I like the compositon, but the lighting is to dim.</td>', 'I like the compositon, but the lighting is to dim.', '2002-09-13 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119291, 5467, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like this but it could do with a bit of brightening up.</td>', 'I like this but it could do with a bit of brightening up.', '2002-09-13 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119292, 5467, 3904, '<td valign="top">excelent idea, but not so good realization.</td>', 'excelent idea, but not so good realization.', '2002-09-14 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119293, 5467, 3903, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  I would happily hang this in my kitchen...!</td>', 'I really like this picture.  I would happily hang this in my kitchen...!', '2002-09-14 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119294, 5467, 1, '<td valign="top">Slightly too dark, better lighting could''ve made this shot more vibrant.</td>', 'Slightly too dark, better lighting could''ve made this shot more vibrant.', '2002-09-14 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119295, 5467, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the mirror effect. You also chose the colours well. Corresponding orange and yellow of the roses to the fruits. But I would have liked it more with a bit more contrast. The black background is not black but grey. Pitch black would accentuated the colours even more. -stephan</td>', 'I like the composition and the mirror effect. You also chose the colours well. Corresponding orange and yellow of the roses to the fruits. But I would have liked it more with a bit more contrast. The black background is not black but grey. Pitch black would accentuated the colours even more. -stephan', '2002-09-14 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119296, 5467, 2829, '<td valign="top">I like it. But it''s slightly out of focus and too dark. Try using a longer shutter speed to make it a bit brighter</td>', 'I like it. But it''s slightly out of focus and too dark. Try using a longer shutter speed to make it a bit brighter', '2002-09-15 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119297, 5469, 117, '<td valign="top">nice job done with the b&amp;w</td>', 'nice job done with the b&w', '2002-09-09 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119298, 5469, 772, '<td valign="top">All I can really say about this photo is that my mind is begging to see it in color... - jmsetzler</td>', 'All I can really say about this photo is that my mind is begging to see it in color... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-09 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119299, 5469, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  I think this shot needs more contrast, esp. between the round melon/squash and the oblong squash-thing.  Color might have helped, IMO.<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Cute title.  I think this shot needs more contrast, esp. between the round melon/squash and the oblong squash-thing.  Color might have helped, IMO.7 Swash', '2002-09-09 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119300, 5469, 2909, '<td valign="top">I would have ranked you higher had this been in color,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,it lacks the contrast needed for a strong black and white photo</td>', 'I would have ranked you higher had this been in color,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,it lacks the contrast needed for a strong black and white photo', '2002-09-09 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(119301, 5469, 2643, '<td valign="top">I would prefer color</td>', 'I would prefer color', '2002-09-10 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119302, 5469, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice idea, and i like the composition of it all.  i''m sure you are getting this question a lot, but why b&amp;w?  pumpkins have great colors usually, and i''m wondering whether that wouldn''t have looked better.  but then, i haven''t seen the original ... oh, and btw, i''m not universally opposed to b&amp;w, i know there''s been much discussion in the forums about that. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'nice idea, and i like the composition of it all.  i''m sure you are getting this question a lot, but why b&w?  pumpkins have great colors usually, and i''m wondering whether that wouldn''t have looked better.  but then, i haven''t seen the original ... oh, and btw, i''m not universally opposed to b&w, i know there''s been much discussion in the forums about that. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-09-11 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119303, 5469, 2700, '<td valign="top">I dont think B&amp;W works too well with this photo....</td>', 'I dont think B&W works too well with this photo....', '2002-09-11 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119304, 5469, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-11 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119305, 5469, 811, '<td valign="top">Though i like this in black and white, it seems a little flat to me.  Maybe if the angle or perspective were different.   Also, it seems a little too tight for me at the top. karmat</td>', 'Though i like this in black and white, it seems a little flat to me.  Maybe if the angle or perspective were different.   Also, it seems a little too tight for me at the top. karmat', '2002-09-13 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119306, 5469, 2997, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been good at doing a b/w or even knowing what to look for in a b/w candidate.  The tonal ranges here are good, there is nothing "blown out" (just learned that term) nor unappealingly too dark.  Still, I don''t think the subjects were a good candidate for b/w.  Technically it is good picture, but the artistic appeal is not of the caliber that would make me want to frame it.</td>', 'I''ve never been good at doing a b/w or even knowing what to look for in a b/w candidate.  The tonal ranges here are good, there is nothing "blown out" (just learned that term) nor unappealingly too dark.  Still, I don''t think the subjects were a good candidate for b/w.  Technically it is good picture, but the artistic appeal is not of the caliber that would make me want to frame it.', '2002-09-14 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119307, 5469, 2798, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W needs quite a bit more contrast to really make the whites white and the blacks black. Otherwise it''s a nicely framed, lit and focussed shot.  7 - floyd</td>', 'B&W needs quite a bit more contrast to really make the whites white and the blacks black. Otherwise it''s a nicely framed, lit and focussed shot.  7 - floyd', '2002-09-14 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119308, 5470, 3313, '<td valign="top">I like it. Colours look great against the black BG 8.</td>', 'I like it. Colours look great against the black BG 8.', '2002-09-09 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119309, 5470, 3679, '<td valign="top">i just love this one...Patricia</td>', 'i just love this one...Patricia', '2002-09-09 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119310, 5470, 2472, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2002-09-09 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119311, 5470, 2344, '<td valign="top">It fits! If you had that corn by itself people would be scratching their head wondering what''s wrong with it! A truly unique idea! 9-BigSmiles</td>', 'It fits! If you had that corn by itself people would be scratching their head wondering what''s wrong with it! A truly unique idea! 9-BigSmiles', '2002-09-10 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119312, 5470, 671, '<td valign="top">very good composition!  I like the echoing of colors and shapes in the corn and pomegranet</td>', 'very good composition!  I like the echoing of colors and shapes in the corn and pomegranet', '2002-09-10 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119313, 5470, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative and a great way to use both Fruits AND vegetables.</td>', 'Very imaginative and a great way to use both Fruits AND vegetables.', '2002-09-10 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119314, 5470, 92, '<td valign="top">I love this photo a lot. I do wish there was a touch more light. The seeds need to pop out more. However, this photo just rocks ! 8 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I love this photo a lot. I do wish there was a touch more light. The seeds need to pop out more. However, this photo just rocks ! 8 Shiiizzzam', '2002-09-10 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119315, 5470, 1143, '<td valign="top">Well...I like the black bg. Good focus &amp; lighting.  The pomegranite just isn''t a very appealing fruit/veggie to me for some reason. Also, the reflections on the bottom are bothering me. My eyes think there''s something wrong b/c I''m seeing double. Technically it''s really good, but it doesn''t have a lot of emotional appeal for me. I''m left wondering exactly why you chose this combination. ~indigo997</td>', 'Well...I like the black bg. Good focus & lighting.  The pomegranite just isn''t a very appealing fruit/veggie to me for some reason. Also, the reflections on the bottom are bothering me. My eyes think there''s something wrong b/c I''m seeing double. Technically it''s really good, but it doesn''t have a lot of emotional appeal for me. I''m left wondering exactly why you chose this combination. ~indigo997', '2002-09-11 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119316, 5470, 436, '<td valign="top">great umor</td>', 'great umor', '2002-09-11 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
