(119352, 5473, 1827, '<td valign="top">The concept is good, but the result is not interesting enough to me.  I think it would work better as 480*640; also, it''s not quite centered, but so close that it WANTS to be.  That makes it look like a mistake.  I think if you want it to be off center it needs to be more obviously so.  Back to the face itself, I think it is maybe the lack of pupils in the eyes that is bothering me.  Not positive though.  Good idea.  5, just-married</td>', 'The concept is good, but the result is not interesting enough to me.  I think it would work better as 480*640; also, it''s not quite centered, but so close that it WANTS to be.  That makes it look like a mistake.  I think if you want it to be off center it needs to be more obviously so.  Back to the face itself, I think it is maybe the lack of pupils in the eyes that is bothering me.  Not positive though.  Good idea.  5, just-married', '2002-09-10 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
