(119391, 5475, 1066, '<td valign="top">Superior work...this style looks oddly familiar..like somebody I always give high marks too :-)  Anyway..well executed..nice choice of background.  Almost perfect.  I treated this as an ad/poster shot and as such I would have wanted the skin of the hand to be a bit less dry looking..I know..I know..we aren''t models and it just missed getting you a 10.  I see lots (meaning 100''s) of shots like this in stock photo samples in my advertising work so I am a bit jaded and most of them use wonderful manicured female hands to push the sex appeal..still great shot 9..hokie</td>', 'Superior work...this style looks oddly familiar..like somebody I always give high marks too :-)  Anyway..well executed..nice choice of background.  Almost perfect.  I treated this as an ad/poster shot and as such I would have wanted the skin of the hand to be a bit less dry looking..I know..I know..we aren''t models and it just missed getting you a 10.  I see lots (meaning 100''s) of shots like this in stock photo samples in my advertising work so I am a bit jaded and most of them use wonderful manicured female hands to push the sex appeal..still great shot 9..hokie', '2002-09-11 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
