(119393, 5475, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love the orange background.  Great use of shutter speed.  Good composition too.  I''m not sure if it is intentional, but it seems to be grainy and at the same time over sharpened/contrasted - also can''t decide if I like that or not--something about the way the fingers look...ant the overly green edge of the lime.  But I still like this much.  Great work and idea.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great shot!  I love the orange background.  Great use of shutter speed.  Good composition too.  I''m not sure if it is intentional, but it seems to be grainy and at the same time over sharpened/contrasted - also can''t decide if I like that or not--something about the way the fingers look...ant the overly green edge of the lime.  But I still like this much.  Great work and idea.  9Ruthann', '2002-09-11 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
