(119453, 5477, 3208, '<td valign="top">Very inaginative.  I would prefer less reflection off the lemon, less of the lemon  and perhaps a little more focus on the lime.  However, I feel you have done a very good jod.  Well done.</td>', 'Very inaginative.  I would prefer less reflection off the lemon, less of the lemon  and perhaps a little more focus on the lime.  However, I feel you have done a very good jod.  Well done.', '2002-09-12 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119454, 5477, 82, '<td valign="top">This one joyously leapt from the screen for me.  Beautiful balance of color (and bold saturation, particularly on the blueberry!) ... I like the dialouge of yellow-and-blue-make-green.  I like your transition from sharp to blurry, from speckled to smooth; I like the repetition of curves, both natural and carved -- and there, the contrast of natural and enhanced.  This photo is, itself, a converstation of comparison and contrast.  To me, this is either a 9 or 10 (points off, maybe for the slightly overblown specular highlight on the lemon).</td>', 'This one joyously leapt from the screen for me.  Beautiful balance of color (and bold saturation, particularly on the blueberry!) ... I like the dialouge of yellow-and-blue-make-green.  I like your transition from sharp to blurry, from speckled to smooth; I like the repetition of curves, both natural and carved -- and there, the contrast of natural and enhanced.  This photo is, itself, a converstation of comparison and contrast.  To me, this is either a 9 or 10 (points off, maybe for the slightly overblown specular highlight on the lemon).', '2002-09-12 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119455, 5477, 2223, '<td valign="top">wow..this is cool! great idea 7--shutterfly</td>', 'wow..this is cool! great idea 7--shutterfly', '2002-09-12 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
