(119457, 5477, 3087, '<td valign="top">So indulge me while I guess how you did this - Since that blue is so artificial let me put forward that it is actually a piece of orange rind and that once you had the picture in photoshop (or whatever tool you use) you did a hue change on the red channel only?<br/>Anyway however you did this, it''s very striking. Look forward to reading the actual methodology after voting.<br/>:)<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'So indulge me while I guess how you did this - Since that blue is so artificial let me put forward that it is actually a piece of orange rind and that once you had the picture in photoshop (or whatever tool you use) you did a hue change on the red channel only?Anyway however you did this, it''s very striking. Look forward to reading the actual methodology after voting.:)8, Kavey', '2002-09-13 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
