(119534, 5480, 2295, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you were going for here.  A slightly slower shutter speed might have given more of a "moving" effect.  It would also have made it a bit brighter.  7</td>', 'I think I know what you were going for here.  A slightly slower shutter speed might have given more of a "moving" effect.  It would also have made it a bit brighter.  7', '2002-09-09 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
