(119537, 5480, 3672, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photograph. However, it seems more blurred thatn an object in motion.</td>', 'I like the idea of this photograph. However, it seems more blurred thatn an object in motion.', '2002-09-10 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
