(119540, 5480, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your use of motion blur in this photo to create a sense of action... I can almost smell this cooking :) - great shot! - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like your use of motion blur in this photo to create a sense of action... I can almost smell this cooking :) - great shot! - jmsetzler', '2002-09-10 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
