(119543, 5480, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good color. A little faster on the shutter to cut the blurring a little, and a little less yellow in the WB would suit my PERSONAL taste a bit better, but I like the idea.  High marks. - mjcecil</td>', 'Good color. A little faster on the shutter to cut the blurring a little, and a little less yellow in the WB would suit my PERSONAL taste a bit better, but I like the idea.  High marks. - mjcecil', '2002-09-11 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
