(119547, 5480, 2780, '<td valign="top">i like this shot, it is a refreshing change to the other photos and is also pretty good. I like the intentional blur because it adds movement and sound. (Okay I''m Bonkers, you dont have to tell me, but the blurryness adds life, and therefor I can hear it cooking.) -- Konador<br/></td>', 'i like this shot, it is a refreshing change to the other photos and is also pretty good. I like the intentional blur because it adds movement and sound. (Okay I''m Bonkers, you dont have to tell me, but the blurryness adds life, and therefor I can hear it cooking.) -- Konador', '2002-09-11 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
