(119559, 5481, 2928, '<td valign="top">This a well taken and technically superb shot It can''t be faulted in that respect, but I find the shot a little clinical. Meets the challenge, and I really like the lighting.  Perhaps the composition isn''t right  but I can''t really say what it is about the picture that doesn''t work. (8)</td>', 'This a well taken and technically superb shot It can''t be faulted in that respect, but I find the shot a little clinical. Meets the challenge, and I really like the lighting.  Perhaps the composition isn''t right  but I can''t really say what it is about the picture that doesn''t work. (8)', '2002-09-10 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
