(119617, 5487, 3616, '<td valign="top">This is truly a magic moment.  Great color!  Could only have been better if you asked the fly to please be still while you adjusted to get a closer shot with more depth...10<br/><br/></td>', 'This is truly a magic moment.  Great color!  Could only have been better if you asked the fly to please be still while you adjusted to get a closer shot with more depth...10', '2002-09-11 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119618, 5487, 1066, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed....Most of the time fly''s on fruit is a kiss of death in shots like this..I work in advertising and one of the things pounded into my head was the negative connotations.  If you do add this kind of element you really needed to get the fly and orange in more focus/detailed to help the poster quality of the shot.<br/><br/>Still very ambitious and well done...8...hokie</td>', 'Very nice indeed....Most of the time fly''s on fruit is a kiss of death in shots like this..I work in advertising and one of the things pounded into my head was the negative connotations.  If you do add this kind of element you really needed to get the fly and orange in more focus/detailed to help the poster quality of the shot.Still very ambitious and well done...8...hokie', '2002-09-11 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119619, 5487, 3832, '<td valign="top">The fly adds interest to the photo.  Also, there is WAY too much space at the top.  I''d drop this shot, but it''s definitely a keeper!</td>', 'The fly adds interest to the photo.  Also, there is WAY too much space at the top.  I''d drop this shot, but it''s definitely a keeper!', '2002-09-11 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
