(119624, 5487, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space! Wrong week though :(<br/>Anyway, I think this is a great photo. I like the good focus on the orange and the fly. Its good how you have included the fly, but only as a secondary thing. It is so easy to accidently make the fly the main focal point but you have suceeded well in avoiding that. 8.<br/>-- Konador</td>', 'Great use of negative space! Wrong week though :(Anyway, I think this is a great photo. I like the good focus on the orange and the fly. Its good how you have included the fly, but only as a secondary thing. It is so easy to accidently make the fly the main focal point but you have suceeded well in avoiding that. 8.-- Konador', '2002-09-13 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
