(119658, 5490, 3080, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I think by the looks of those leaves that those tomoatos need all the help they can get.  Angle and framing are good, and the lighting is also good.  Focus and clarity are great.  Overall interesting photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'Cute idea.  I think by the looks of those leaves that those tomoatos need all the help they can get.  Angle and framing are good, and the lighting is also good.  Focus and clarity are great.  Overall interesting photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119659, 5490, 3112, '<td valign="top">Definitely creative.  Color is excellent.  Need a different lighting source.  Focus is a tad soft in parts.  Stop ALL the way down, if necessary, to get it all to pop.</td>', 'Definitely creative.  Color is excellent.  Need a different lighting source.  Focus is a tad soft in parts.  Stop ALL the way down, if necessary, to get it all to pop.', '2002-09-11 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
