(119758, 5496, 2829, '<td valign="top">An abstracty fruit :) I''m guessing you''re getting hammered for this..I would have chosen a more interesting angle but otherwise it''s well done. As a side note...I think it''s a major misconception that "abstract" has to be out of focus...It doesn''t. A perfectly focused shot without a "Kiwi" in the title would have been just as abstract since it''s not easily identifiable but can be figured out/guessed.</td>', 'An abstracty fruit :) I''m guessing you''re getting hammered for this..I would have chosen a more interesting angle but otherwise it''s well done. As a side note...I think it''s a major misconception that "abstract" has to be out of focus...It doesn''t. A perfectly focused shot without a "Kiwi" in the title would have been just as abstract since it''s not easily identifiable but can be figured out/guessed.', '2002-09-13 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
