(119802, 5500, 2997, '<td valign="top">I like nearly everything about this picture.  The focus is just right.  I like the framing.  The color is wonderful, even though it is "just" green.<br/><br/>To improve the picture I would suggest using a softer lighting to prevent the glare.  Also, a spotlight on the stem would have prevented to dominent darkness there.  It is possible that you intended that darkness, I don''t know.</td>', 'I like nearly everything about this picture.  The focus is just right.  I like the framing.  The color is wonderful, even though it is "just" green.To improve the picture I would suggest using a softer lighting to prevent the glare.  Also, a spotlight on the stem would have prevented to dominent darkness there.  It is possible that you intended that darkness, I don''t know.', '2002-09-12 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119803, 5500, 3087, '<td valign="top">7, Kavey</td>', '7, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119804, 5500, 312, '<td valign="top">peppers are very photogenic, i think. this is nicely done. maybe a tad underexposed, as you lose a bit of the detail in the darker shadow areas. also, that lone water drop in the upper left corner is kind of distracting. i think it would either look better totally dry or maybe even totally wet. also, maybe a slightly wider crop would show more of the pepper and add to the textures and bumps of the overall shot. good work.</td>', 'peppers are very photogenic, i think. this is nicely done. maybe a tad underexposed, as you lose a bit of the detail in the darker shadow areas. also, that lone water drop in the upper left corner is kind of distracting. i think it would either look better totally dry or maybe even totally wet. also, maybe a slightly wider crop would show more of the pepper and add to the textures and bumps of the overall shot. good work.', '2002-09-13 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119805, 5500, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro.  Good focus. karmat</td>', 'Excellent macro.  Good focus. karmat', '2002-09-13 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
