(119830, 5503, 1005, '<td valign="top">Most great, I see three issues that I don''t care for in order of badness.  Showing this much of the pepper w/o the bend of the stem (cropped at the top too much), don''t know why, but the top of the pepper seems softly focused, could be from the reflection and finally, it''s really a nit, but the bottom of the pepper is barely obscurred, I want to see the whole pepper.  More follage might have been nice.  8 Swash</td>', 'Most great, I see three issues that I don''t care for in order of badness.  Showing this much of the pepper w/o the bend of the stem (cropped at the top too much), don''t know why, but the top of the pepper seems softly focused, could be from the reflection and finally, it''s really a nit, but the bottom of the pepper is barely obscurred, I want to see the whole pepper.  More follage might have been nice.  8 Swash', '2002-09-09 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
