(119893, 5508, 1829, '<td valign="top">I love your creativity here.  Fantastic colours.  Well done!!</td>', 'I love your creativity here.  Fantastic colours.  Well done!!', '2002-09-10 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119894, 5508, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and I like the title.  Focus is very good.  Nice use of negative space.  (getting ready for next week!)  Framing is very nice.  Good color!  9 Swash</td>', 'Great shot, and I like the title.  Focus is very good.  Nice use of negative space.  (getting ready for next week!)  Framing is very nice.  Good color!  9 Swash', '2002-09-10 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119895, 5508, 3080, '<td valign="top">Ok..I get it!  LOL.  I''ve never seen a Papaya before, so I was thinking that this is was they really looked like, with the green seeds inside.  Then I noticed the title. I''m so gullible. LOL.  This is a really neat photo.  Extra points for fooling me.  I like the angle and the framing is very nice.  Was there some color modification done? The top of the photo is turning a bit pink and the top of the back fruit is a bit red.  Then again, I''ve never seen one of these, so I could be wong.  The focus and clarity are great.  I like how you can almost count each and every pea.  Overall really nice photo!  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'Ok..I get it!  LOL.  I''ve never seen a Papaya before, so I was thinking that this is was they really looked like, with the green seeds inside.  Then I noticed the title. I''m so gullible. LOL.  This is a really neat photo.  Extra points for fooling me.  I like the angle and the framing is very nice.  Was there some color modification done? The top of the photo is turning a bit pink and the top of the back fruit is a bit red.  Then again, I''ve never seen one of these, so I could be wong.  The focus and clarity are great.  I like how you can almost count each and every pea.  Overall really nice photo!  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119896, 5508, 368, '<td valign="top">i love this ... what a very creative mind .. pee pyaya ... i almost "peed" my pants when i first saw this- LOL - it''s great .. nice and brightly colored - i just wish there were a little more shadows - ayme-9</td>', 'i love this ... what a very creative mind .. pee pyaya ... i almost "peed" my pants when i first saw this- LOL - it''s great .. nice and brightly colored - i just wish there were a little more shadows - ayme-9', '2002-09-10 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119897, 5508, 2667, '<td valign="top">great shot. wonderful color and texture. would like to have the peas spilling out of the fruit, i think that would have been neat.  (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'great shot. wonderful color and texture. would like to have the peas spilling out of the fruit, i think that would have been neat.  (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-11 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119898, 5508, 436, '<td valign="top">tasty and pretty, too (great humor)</td>', 'tasty and pretty, too (great humor)', '2002-09-11 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119899, 5508, 3839, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2002-09-11 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
