(119917, 5509, 3778, '<td valign="top">very nice, the bottom of the picture is somewhat out of focus though</td>', 'very nice, the bottom of the picture is somewhat out of focus though', '2002-09-09 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119918, 5509, 1041, '<td valign="top">you instantly made it into my top 5 this week.  the idea and the execution of it is just outstanding.  i love that you chose a yellow background and how you suspended the lemon with the drop in the air.  the arrangement of the other objects works well, too.  one tiny nitpick would be the reflections in the bottle.  -- gr8photos (10).</td>', 'you instantly made it into my top 5 this week.  the idea and the execution of it is just outstanding.  i love that you chose a yellow background and how you suspended the lemon with the drop in the air.  the arrangement of the other objects works well, too.  one tiny nitpick would be the reflections in the bottle.  -- gr8photos (10).', '2002-09-09 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119919, 5509, 2837, '<td valign="top">it''s floating!</td>', 'it''s floating!', '2002-09-09 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119920, 5509, 2553, '<td valign="top">There is nothing about this photo that I don''t like, but it lacks that "SOMETHING"  that keeps it from being a 10 for me. lhall-9</td>', 'There is nothing about this photo that I don''t like, but it lacks that "SOMETHING"  that keeps it from being a 10 for me. lhall-9', '2002-09-09 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119921, 5509, 3127, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo! I love the stop action as well.</td>', 'Wonderful photo! I love the stop action as well.', '2002-09-09 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119922, 5509, 3691, '<td valign="top">I like it. too bad about the glare off the glass,but that must be hard to achieve. Everythinig is in focus except the cork?</td>', 'I like it. too bad about the glare off the glass,but that must be hard to achieve. Everythinig is in focus except the cork?', '2002-09-09 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119923, 5509, 1779, '<td valign="top">very cool!</td>', 'very cool!', '2002-09-09 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119924, 5509, 1189, '<td valign="top">A very fresh and summer-feelin picture, how is it sticking there?</td>', 'A very fresh and summer-feelin picture, how is it sticking there?', '2002-09-09 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119925, 5509, 3161, '<td valign="top">Very creative - great execution!</td>', 'Very creative - great execution!', '2002-09-09 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119926, 5509, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and atractive. I like the work on the yellowish atmosphere. I only wished the cork and the first plane lemon were in focus. Good work.</td>', 'Very elegant and atractive. I like the work on the yellowish atmosphere. I only wished the cork and the first plane lemon were in focus. Good work.', '2002-09-09 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119927, 5509, 637, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  8 sjgleah</td>', 'Very well done.  8 sjgleah', '2002-09-10 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119928, 5509, 3672, '<td valign="top">I gave this a high (9) vote because the composition is great! and I liked how well it blended together.... but the only thing I didn''t like was all the yellow (maybe because that was my least favorite color) But, if you were to use a different background color, I don''t think I would have voted as High, so good job! (humans or so complicated aren''t they??)</td>', 'I gave this a high (9) vote because the composition is great! and I liked how well it blended together.... but the only thing I didn''t like was all the yellow (maybe because that was my least favorite color) But, if you were to use a different background color, I don''t think I would have voted as High, so good job! (humans or so complicated aren''t they??)', '2002-09-10 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119929, 5509, 2928, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, highly inventive, great composition and superb use of colour.  I''d love to know how you achieved the floating lemon effect :o) (10)</td>', 'Clever shot, highly inventive, great composition and superb use of colour.  I''d love to know how you achieved the floating lemon effect :o) (10)', '2002-09-10 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119930, 5509, 3612, '<td valign="top">great photo!</td>', 'great photo!', '2002-09-10 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119931, 5509, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I have to ask, How did you suspend the lemon slice?  For some reason, the cork seems soft, but the rest of the shot is crystal clear, so it must just be me.  The drop from the slice is a wonderful touch.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice.  I have to ask, How did you suspend the lemon slice?  For some reason, the cork seems soft, but the rest of the shot is crystal clear, so it must just be me.  The drop from the slice is a wonderful touch.  9 Swash', '2002-09-10 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119932, 5509, 1826, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this one with a more contrasting backround. Great composition.</td>', 'I''d like to see this one with a more contrasting backround. Great composition.', '2002-09-10 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119933, 5509, 1897, '<td valign="top">Technical:  Exposure/focus/composition - 8<br/>Style/originality - 8<br/>Overall 8<br/>Good effort.<br/></td>', 'Technical:  Exposure/focus/composition - 8Style/originality - 8Overall 8Good effort.', '2002-09-10 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119934, 5509, 2183, '<td valign="top">interesting. I still can''t figure out how you did that.....very nice</td>', 'interesting. I still can''t figure out how you did that.....very nice', '2002-09-10 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119935, 5509, 2866, '<td valign="top">Nice tone.</td>', 'Nice tone.', '2002-09-10 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119936, 5509, 2437, '<td valign="top">background should not be that yellow, but the concept is cool... did you hang the lemon-cut? 6</td>', 'background should not be that yellow, but the concept is cool... did you hang the lemon-cut? 6', '2002-09-11 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119937, 5509, 1143, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. The bright reflections on the glass and lemon are the only real distraction. I like the continuation of yellow with the bg. The cork and front lemon seem a tad out of focus perhaps. ~indigo997</td>', 'One of my favorites. The bright reflections on the glass and lemon are the only real distraction. I like the continuation of yellow with the bg. The cork and front lemon seem a tad out of focus perhaps. ~indigo997', '2002-09-11 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119938, 5509, 133, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the color yellow in this shot.</td>', 'Nice use of the color yellow in this shot.', '2002-09-11 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119939, 5509, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the color yellow.</td>', 'Very nice use of the color yellow.', '2002-09-11 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119940, 5509, 2350, '<td valign="top">One of the best of many.  Gets my ten and I love yellow.</td>', 'One of the best of many.  Gets my ten and I love yellow.', '2002-09-11 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119941, 5509, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred a contrasting background.</td>', 'I''d have preferred a contrasting background.', '2002-09-11 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119942, 5509, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot :)  I like the yellow... I would really like this shot if the surface was more even across the botton and the lighting on the background was more even also :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting shot :)  I like the yellow... I would really like this shot if the surface was more even across the botton and the lighting on the background was more even also :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-11 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119943, 5509, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-09-11 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119944, 5509, 1617, '<td valign="top">how do you get it to flowt?</td>', 'how do you get it to flowt?', '2002-09-12 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119945, 5509, 2752, '<td valign="top">nicely done study in yellow (8)</td>', 'nicely done study in yellow (8)', '2002-09-12 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119946, 5509, 573, '<td valign="top">I love the all yellow theam of this picture.  Just a nit-pick, only because I''ve been hit hard with it in the last several challenges, the soft focus in the forground doesn''t go over well on this site.  One of my top ten.</td>', 'I love the all yellow theam of this picture.  Just a nit-pick, only because I''ve been hit hard with it in the last several challenges, the soft focus in the forground doesn''t go over well on this site.  One of my top ten.', '2002-09-12 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119947, 5509, 2983, '<td valign="top">Great single-color work.</td>', 'Great single-color work.', '2002-09-12 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119948, 5509, 2223, '<td valign="top">this pic would go well in my kitchen, nice yellow 7--shutterfly</td>', 'this pic would go well in my kitchen, nice yellow 7--shutterfly', '2002-09-12 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119949, 5509, 82, '<td valign="top">Beautiful yellow hue ... nicely consistent.  The particular yellow you used supports the lemon concept wonderfully (as opposed to, say, buttercups or some other yellow thing).  I like your light and shadows, the dry and wet, the smooth and dimpled -- all very nice contrasts, held together by a central theme.</td>', 'Beautiful yellow hue ... nicely consistent.  The particular yellow you used supports the lemon concept wonderfully (as opposed to, say, buttercups or some other yellow thing).  I like your light and shadows, the dry and wet, the smooth and dimpled -- all very nice contrasts, held together by a central theme.', '2002-09-12 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119950, 5509, 3419, '<td valign="top">Ohhh! Nicely done, though that uncut lemon looks a little green.... I love the bold yellow background, and however did you suspend that lemon slice?</td>', 'Ohhh! Nicely done, though that uncut lemon looks a little green.... I love the bold yellow background, and however did you suspend that lemon slice?', '2002-09-12 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119951, 5509, 3087, '<td valign="top">7, Kavey</td>', '7, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119952, 5509, 2344, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Makes me want some lemonade! Too bad the gradation in your background idn''t completely smooth.. there''s that dark spot on the right. Your image seems to have a slight green cast to it.. but that could just be my monitor..<br/>Love it! 10</td>', 'Wonderful! Makes me want some lemonade! Too bad the gradation in your background idn''t completely smooth.. there''s that dark spot on the right. Your image seems to have a slight green cast to it.. but that could just be my monitor..Love it! 10', '2002-09-13 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119953, 5509, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the whole yellowness of this shot. Its good how you appear to have got the lemon floating above the jug, and still kept a drop of juice on it. I have a couple of down points aswell. I think the glare on the jug is a bit too bright. True, it adds contrast to the piece, but I think it should be a little less bright. Also, the shadow on the lemon behind is green, and I think that takes away a bit from the prominently yellow photo. I''m not sure how you could have avoided this. One last thing, The whole photo seems slightly out of focus to me. Now this most likley is that when you resized the photo down, it caused a blur, even if the original photo was in perfect focus. Try adding a sharpen filter to it.<br/>8<br/>-Konador</td>', 'I like the whole yellowness of this shot. Its good how you appear to have got the lemon floating above the jug, and still kept a drop of juice on it. I have a couple of down points aswell. I think the glare on the jug is a bit too bright. True, it adds contrast to the piece, but I think it should be a little less bright. Also, the shadow on the lemon behind is green, and I think that takes away a bit from the prominently yellow photo. I''m not sure how you could have avoided this. One last thing, The whole photo seems slightly out of focus to me. Now this most likley is that when you resized the photo down, it caused a blur, even if the original photo was in perfect focus. Try adding a sharpen filter to it.8-Konador', '2002-09-13 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119954, 5509, 1759, '<td valign="top">I really like this arrangement. To me it demonstrates a keen sense of composition, arrangement, and artistic development. I think that it would be a top rated image if it were sharper and without the technical lighting problems, such as excessive reflections and blown out highlights.</td>', 'I really like this arrangement. To me it demonstrates a keen sense of composition, arrangement, and artistic development. I think that it would be a top rated image if it were sharper and without the technical lighting problems, such as excessive reflections and blown out highlights.', '2002-09-13 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119955, 5509, 2781, '<td valign="top">great colors!</td>', 'great colors!', '2002-09-13 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119956, 5509, 3035, '<td valign="top">great color combo 8</td>', 'great color combo 8', '2002-09-14 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119957, 5509, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like the double lemon "drop" effect; also like the yellow tonality of the image. The image could be sharper; also the lighting could have been better controlled, i.e. the harsh reflections on the bottle. Creative idea. 8 Journey</td>', 'Like the double lemon "drop" effect; also like the yellow tonality of the image. The image could be sharper; also the lighting could have been better controlled, i.e. the harsh reflections on the bottle. Creative idea. 8 Journey', '2002-09-14 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119958, 5509, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce</td>', 'Very nice! Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce', '2002-09-14 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119959, 5509, 368, '<td valign="top">oh very nice shot ... i wonder what the shot woulda looked like with an orange back ground or red .... i like the yellow though - i could see this hanging up in my kitchen - ayme-8</td>', 'oh very nice shot ... i wonder what the shot woulda looked like with an orange back ground or red .... i like the yellow though - i could see this hanging up in my kitchen - ayme-8', '2002-09-14 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119960, 5509, 2798, '<td valign="top">Highlights seem a little too much but otherwise a great idea and VERY well done. Love the yellow background especially. 8 - floyd.</td>', 'Highlights seem a little too much but otherwise a great idea and VERY well done. Love the yellow background especially. 8 - floyd.', '2002-09-14 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119961, 5509, 3247, '<td valign="top">IMPACT!!! Yeah!</td>', 'IMPACT!!! Yeah!', '2002-09-14 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119962, 5509, 3208, '<td valign="top">How did you suspend the lemon?  I really like this photo and have to say that the background really does make a pleasant change from the obvious BLACK.  Perhaps there is too much glare on the glass jug, but overall an excellent piece of work.  Well-done!</td>', 'How did you suspend the lemon?  I really like this photo and have to say that the background really does make a pleasant change from the obvious BLACK.  Perhaps there is too much glare on the glass jug, but overall an excellent piece of work.  Well-done!', '2002-09-15 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119963, 5509, 2634, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I''m sure we will find out how the lemon slice is suspended after this ends.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I''m sure we will find out how the lemon slice is suspended after this ends.', '2002-09-15 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119964, 5509, 2867, '<td valign="top">Very cool! The only thing that bothers me is the greenish tint to the back lemon.  Other than that, GREAT!</td>', 'Very cool! The only thing that bothers me is the greenish tint to the back lemon.  Other than that, GREAT!', '2002-09-15 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119965, 5510, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice shot, but the shadows darken your subjects a bit too much.  Sun and shadows in the same shot are always difficult.  7 Swash</td>', 'This is a pretty nice shot, but the shadows darken your subjects a bit too much.  Sun and shadows in the same shot are always difficult.  7 Swash', '2002-09-09 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119966, 5510, 2909, '<td valign="top">did you consider using a dish with less pattern?  perhaps a solid color would have provided a better background for the colorful and rough textured things you used.</td>', 'did you consider using a dish with less pattern?  perhaps a solid color would have provided a better background for the colorful and rough textured things you used.', '2002-09-09 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119967, 5510, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 9,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 9,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-09-09 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119968, 5510, 3672, '<td valign="top">I had a hard time trying to decide how to rate this shot. I''m trying to think about how I might have don this differently. I think I would have tried different combinations of arranging the items, or perhaps a close up of the textures these items provide. One step further perhaps a close up of the shadows of the textures.</td>', 'I had a hard time trying to decide how to rate this shot. I''m trying to think about how I might have don this differently. I think I would have tried different combinations of arranging the items, or perhaps a close up of the textures these items provide. One step further perhaps a close up of the shadows of the textures.', '2002-09-10 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119969, 5510, 2158, '<td valign="top">The fancy plate detracts from the shape of the vegetables.</td>', 'The fancy plate detracts from the shape of the vegetables.', '2002-09-10 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119970, 5510, 3741, '<td valign="top">lighting''s nice, subject isn''t.</td>', 'lighting''s nice, subject isn''t.', '2002-09-11 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119971, 5510, 3832, '<td valign="top">This is a good attempt by the photographer, but I have some suggestions:  Next time, use a simpler plate.  The textures and patterns on the veggies, combined with that pretty and fancy plate makes the shot WAY too busy.  The eye doesn''t know where to look!</td>', 'This is a good attempt by the photographer, but I have some suggestions:  Next time, use a simpler plate.  The textures and patterns on the veggies, combined with that pretty and fancy plate makes the shot WAY too busy.  The eye doesn''t know where to look!', '2002-09-11 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119972, 5510, 1897, '<td valign="top">very good compostion, but I think more even lighting would improve the image, as well as pumping up the contrast and the saturation.    The colors work well together,  but what is the black stuff at the top?  It looks like magic marker.</td>', 'very good compostion, but I think more even lighting would improve the image, as well as pumping up the contrast and the saturation.    The colors work well together,  but what is the black stuff at the top?  It looks like magic marker.', '2002-09-12 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119973, 5510, 3087, '<td valign="top">The fruit have all the colour and texture needed. The colourful plate really distracts from that. I''d shoot them on a plain white or other neutral colour background to really focus on their shape and beauty.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'The fruit have all the colour and texture needed. The colourful plate really distracts from that. I''d shoot them on a plain white or other neutral colour background to really focus on their shape and beauty.Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(119974, 5510, 811, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this gives it a nice cheerful feeling, I think.  Did you try different angle perspectives (lower, etc.)?  karmat</td>', 'The lighting on this gives it a nice cheerful feeling, I think.  Did you try different angle perspectives (lower, etc.)?  karmat', '2002-09-13 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
