(119988, 5511, 1041, '<td valign="top">i have to admit ... i''m somewhat baffled by this image.  this does not look like mist, but also not like rain (even though the leaves and raspberries are definitely wet), the lines are not all going into the same direction.  it almost looks more as if you photographed this through a scratched window or something.  i''ll be curious to see your description next week. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'i have to admit ... i''m somewhat baffled by this image.  this does not look like mist, but also not like rain (even though the leaves and raspberries are definitely wet), the lines are not all going into the same direction.  it almost looks more as if you photographed this through a scratched window or something.  i''ll be curious to see your description next week. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-12 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
