(119999, 5512, 811, '<td valign="top">this is too funny.  It seems to be a sunny day, so would it have been possible to use a faster shutter speed and gotten the pineapple a little sharper?Otherwise, a great picture.  karmat</td>', 'this is too funny.  It seems to be a sunny day, so would it have been possible to use a faster shutter speed and gotten the pineapple a little sharper?Otherwise, a great picture.  karmat', '2002-09-09 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120000, 5512, 1005, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t try to catch the pineapple, they''re ouchy!  I get the sense of motion from the pineapple, but frozen might have given you more punch.  Lots of negative space...(off a week?)  7 Swash</td>', 'I hope you didn''t try to catch the pineapple, they''re ouchy!  I get the sense of motion from the pineapple, but frozen might have given you more punch.  Lots of negative space...(off a week?)  7 Swash', '2002-09-09 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120001, 5512, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a really superb shot  and a first class example of how to use negative space :o)  I really think I''m looking at a possible challenge winner here; it''s inventive, technically outstanding and grabs the attention more effectively that being slapped in the face with a particularly large Bloater fish I cannot express how good this picture is, if it were a poster, I''d definitely buy it (10+++)</td>', 'This is a really superb shot  and a first class example of how to use negative space :o)  I really think I''m looking at a possible challenge winner here; it''s inventive, technically outstanding and grabs the attention more effectively that being slapped in the face with a particularly large Bloater fish I cannot express how good this picture is, if it were a poster, I''d definitely buy it (10+++)', '2002-09-10 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
