(120031, 5513, 1547, '<td valign="top">Comment from photographer: Thanks for all your comments. They are very helpful and I appreciate the time you took to make them. I do have a surprise for some of you -- there are no real pears in the photo.  They are all glass or ceramic. The one on the right that looks real is made by an artist in England.  Even up close you can''t tell that it is fake.</td>', 'Comment from photographer: Thanks for all your comments. They are very helpful and I appreciate the time you took to make them. I do have a surprise for some of you -- there are no real pears in the photo.  They are all glass or ceramic. The one on the right that looks real is made by an artist in England.  Even up close you can''t tell that it is fake.', '2002-09-17 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
