(120042, 5514, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hmm nice idea. I don''t think it looks that much like a molecule tho. I think to make it look more like one you could have used more fruit, and actually shown the sticks that hold them together, like on those huge models that you always see in films :) I do like this photo though. Very nice vibrant colours look great against the black background, and I like the water droplets on the fruit. I think if you used a fully ripened lemon it could look better, because it would be all yellow without the shade of green, but good photo none-the-less.<br/>7<br/>Konador</td>', 'Hmm nice idea. I don''t think it looks that much like a molecule tho. I think to make it look more like one you could have used more fruit, and actually shown the sticks that hold them together, like on those huge models that you always see in films :) I do like this photo though. Very nice vibrant colours look great against the black background, and I like the water droplets on the fruit. I think if you used a fully ripened lemon it could look better, because it would be all yellow without the shade of green, but good photo none-the-less.7Konador', '2002-09-14 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120043, 5514, 1280, '<td valign="top">very nice. Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce</td>', 'very nice. Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce', '2002-09-14 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
