(120049, 5516, 3018, '<td valign="top">This picture is great.  My wife had this idea, but we forgot to try it.  The transparency is good, and the stop motion on the juice drops is great.</td>', 'This picture is great.  My wife had this idea, but we forgot to try it.  The transparency is good, and the stop motion on the juice drops is great.', '2002-09-09 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
