(120051, 5516, 2837, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2002-09-09 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120052, 5516, 1856, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...love the drips...would have liked a bit more saturation here..maybe a little curve tweak too 8 Lisa</td>', 'Nice composition...love the drips...would have liked a bit more saturation here..maybe a little curve tweak too 8 Lisa', '2002-09-09 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120053, 5516, 3354, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Nice shot. How fast was this shot? 1/1000, or faster?  This is amazing.  I certainly think this deserves to be in the top three, if not the winner. What''s good: 1. the glow in the lemon 2. they clouds are JUST right, not too far past the lemon 3. the glow of the lemon. 3. the stop footage on that drop. Man how awesome is that!  4. did i mention the glow in the lemon :)  - phlebotiss.</td>', 'Oh wow. Nice shot. How fast was this shot? 1/1000, or faster?  This is amazing.  I certainly think this deserves to be in the top three, if not the winner. What''s good: 1. the glow in the lemon 2. they clouds are JUST right, not too far past the lemon 3. the glow of the lemon. 3. the stop footage on that drop. Man how awesome is that!  4. did i mention the glow in the lemon :)  - phlebotiss.', '2002-09-09 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120054, 5516, 2607, '<td valign="top">nice fotografia</td>', 'nice fotografia', '2002-09-09 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120055, 5516, 3672, '<td valign="top">Nice focus!  I like the lighted star burst in the bottom droplett!</td>', 'Nice focus!  I like the lighted star burst in the bottom droplett!', '2002-09-10 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120056, 5516, 51167, '<td valign="top">Love the drip.  Perfect shot!!</td>', 'Love the drip.  Perfect shot!!', '2002-09-10 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120057, 5516, 3273, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  One of my favorites.  I wonder how many times it took you to get the drop just right!  Nice clarity, good definition of the inside of the lemon.  Well done.  10/10</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  One of my favorites.  I wonder how many times it took you to get the drop just right!  Nice clarity, good definition of the inside of the lemon.  Well done.  10/10', '2002-09-10 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120058, 5516, 1829, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot.  Great colour.  Seems to give a feeling of ''Nice and fresh''.  Fantastic shot.</td>', 'Brilliant shot.  Great colour.  Seems to give a feeling of ''Nice and fresh''.  Fantastic shot.', '2002-09-10 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120059, 5516, 2437, '<td valign="top">i am giving tons of 10s now...</td>', 'i am giving tons of 10s now...', '2002-09-10 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120060, 5516, 3808, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. How did you get that light? Excellent detail on the juice. Makes my mouth water. Congratulations</td>', 'Brilliant. How did you get that light? Excellent detail on the juice. Makes my mouth water. Congratulations', '2002-09-10 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120061, 5516, 3612, '<td valign="top">great concept!</td>', 'great concept!', '2002-09-10 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120062, 5516, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is wonderful.  The stars in the drops is a great touch!  The texture of the lemon slice is great.  The closest thing to a complaint that I can come up with is the lighting across the lemon isn''t very even.  Golly.  9 Swash</td>', 'Wow, this is wonderful.  The stars in the drops is a great touch!  The texture of the lemon slice is great.  The closest thing to a complaint that I can come up with is the lighting across the lemon isn''t very even.  Golly.  9 Swash', '2002-09-10 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120063, 5516, 2130, '<td valign="top">simple and beautiful...a 10!</td>', 'simple and beautiful...a 10!', '2002-09-10 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120064, 5516, 616, '<td valign="top">This is an all around great picture. I was going to attempt to try a shot like this, but I soon found that it was very difficult. Yours came out great.</td>', 'This is an all around great picture. I was going to attempt to try a shot like this, but I soon found that it was very difficult. Yours came out great.', '2002-09-10 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120065, 5516, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I was going to do a lime with the light behind it and call it "Lime Light" - but couldn''t get it to work (because of skills and old lime - lol)  I like the sky, the drops are almost too perfect!  Excellent texture.  Get the feeling that you are actually holding it right here.  Great work  10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very nice!  I was going to do a lime with the light behind it and call it "Lime Light" - but couldn''t get it to work (because of skills and old lime - lol)  I like the sky, the drops are almost too perfect!  Excellent texture.  Get the feeling that you are actually holding it right here.  Great work  10Ruthann', '2002-09-10 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120066, 5516, 772, '<td valign="top">This water drop is perfect :)  I love the blue and yellow in this image... great work :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This water drop is perfect :)  I love the blue and yellow in this image... great work :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-10 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120067, 5516, 368, '<td valign="top">kinda gives a new look at the sun!!!! and liquid sunshine!!! (we have that here in FL) ayme-9</td>', 'kinda gives a new look at the sun!!!! and liquid sunshine!!! (we have that here in FL) ayme-9', '2002-09-10 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120068, 5516, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m thirsty just from looking at this one... great execution! My only critique would be to tighten the crop by a few pixels on either side to get rid of the blue to the left and right of the lemon at the very top.  -ClubJuggle</td>', 'I''m thirsty just from looking at this one... great execution! My only critique would be to tighten the crop by a few pixels on either side to get rid of the blue to the left and right of the lemon at the very top.  -ClubJuggle', '2002-09-10 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120069, 5516, 3294, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Although the rind takes away some of the pop.  Not sure how else it could have been done.  I still like this a lot though.  - 9</td>', 'Beautiful!  Although the rind takes away some of the pop.  Not sure how else it could have been done.  I still like this a lot though.  - 9', '2002-09-11 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120070, 5516, 3178, '<td valign="top">Oo.. nice job getting that drop to stretch out!</td>', 'Oo.. nice job getting that drop to stretch out!', '2002-09-11 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120071, 5516, 133, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-09-11 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120072, 5516, 2667, '<td valign="top">great photo for sure. the sun kissed droplets are a nice effect that really make this shot stand out. (9)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'great photo for sure. the sun kissed droplets are a nice effect that really make this shot stand out. (9)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-11 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120073, 5516, 1066, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea.  Love the color.  it seems as if the shot was done indoors against a window.  I would have liked a more translucent appearance to the lemon and greater surface detail..still..very nice  8..hokie</td>', 'Fantastic idea.  Love the color.  it seems as if the shot was done indoors against a window.  I would have liked a more translucent appearance to the lemon and greater surface detail..still..very nice  8..hokie', '2002-09-11 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120074, 5516, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looks kind of like an advertisement!  Love the droplets against the sky.  The lemon slice is too dark for me, I would have liked to have seen the bright yellow against the sky. lhall-7</td>', 'Looks kind of like an advertisement!  Love the droplets against the sky.  The lemon slice is too dark for me, I would have liked to have seen the bright yellow against the sky. lhall-7', '2002-09-11 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120075, 5516, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like everything about this picture.  Good work!  karmat</td>', 'Very nice.  I like everything about this picture.  Good work!  karmat', '2002-09-11 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120076, 5516, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is one of my 10s for the week, but I don''t really know what to even say about it. It''s just a very well done, attractive shot. I like the lighting, colors, composition, and focus. The drip adds so much to the shot. ~indigo997</td>', 'This is one of my 10s for the week, but I don''t really know what to even say about it. It''s just a very well done, attractive shot. I like the lighting, colors, composition, and focus. The drip adds so much to the shot. ~indigo997', '2002-09-11 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120077, 5516, 2079, '<td valign="top">It''s just a little over exposed for my taste, but I like it. The drip adds a nice touch. Good Luck, Gotcha 8</td>', 'It''s just a little over exposed for my taste, but I like it. The drip adds a nice touch. Good Luck, Gotcha 8', '2002-09-12 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120078, 5516, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superb effort.  I really like the shot; it''s an ingenious use of light, and yes, it really does looked kissed by the sun.  I can''t say anything constructive or helpful; composition is spot on, use of colour and light is outstanding, stop motion is marvellous, focus  oh, why am I going on Easy (10)</td>', 'This is a superb effort.  I really like the shot; it''s an ingenious use of light, and yes, it really does looked kissed by the sun.  I can''t say anything constructive or helpful; composition is spot on, use of colour and light is outstanding, stop motion is marvellous, focus  oh, why am I going on Easy (10)', '2002-09-12 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120079, 5516, 2798, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT water droplets and great light. Well done! 9 - floyd</td>', 'EXCELLENT water droplets and great light. Well done! 9 - floyd', '2002-09-12 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120080, 5516, 82, '<td valign="top">I love the cloudy sky and the mixture of blue and yellow.  The water droplets are sensuous and add a reminder of what makes lemons so great.  I''d like to see a brighter yellow, a slightly higher color saturation.</td>', 'I love the cloudy sky and the mixture of blue and yellow.  The water droplets are sensuous and add a reminder of what makes lemons so great.  I''d like to see a brighter yellow, a slightly higher color saturation.', '2002-09-12 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120081, 5516, 2223, '<td valign="top">this is very pretty, makes me thirsty 7--shutterfly</td>', 'this is very pretty, makes me thirsty 7--shutterfly', '2002-09-12 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120082, 5516, 3087, '<td valign="top">Would like a little more light from front - a fill-in flash perhaps?<br/>The water droplets are just beautiful.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Would like a little more light from front - a fill-in flash perhaps?The water droplets are just beautiful.8, Kavey', '2002-09-13 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120083, 5516, 312, '<td valign="top">a nice effect, but i feel like the image is really soft and loses a lot of the color range. this may have benefited nicely from a polorizing filter to give that sky more punch. overall, though, a nicely timed and composed shot.</td>', 'a nice effect, but i feel like the image is really soft and loses a lot of the color range. this may have benefited nicely from a polorizing filter to give that sky more punch. overall, though, a nicely timed and composed shot.', '2002-09-13 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120084, 5516, 2781, '<td valign="top">awesome picture, love the droplet, and the light behind the fruit!</td>', 'awesome picture, love the droplet, and the light behind the fruit!', '2002-09-13 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120085, 5516, 1897, '<td valign="top">Another one worthy of display.</td>', 'Another one worthy of display.', '2002-09-13 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
