(120089, 5516, 3669, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say that every time I look at this photo, I want to pucker.  I assume that this is a lemon slice, but with the lighting, it''s really tough to tell for sure...could be an orange slice.  However, I like the refection you captured on the water drop.  Good job!!</td>', 'Just wanted to say that every time I look at this photo, I want to pucker.  I assume that this is a lemon slice, but with the lighting, it''s really tough to tell for sure...could be an orange slice.  However, I like the refection you captured on the water drop.  Good job!!', '2002-09-14 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120090, 5516, 1439, '<td valign="top">Great, This is the best one in this challenge</td>', 'Great, This is the best one in this challenge', '2002-09-14 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120091, 5516, 142, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!  I can''t believe how well you captured the drop coming off of the lemon slice.</td>', 'Outstanding!  I can''t believe how well you captured the drop coming off of the lemon slice.', '2002-09-14 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120092, 5516, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-14 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120093, 5516, 656, '<td valign="top">great, but could do with being under exposed a stop or so to bring out the lemon and sky colours - maybe a polarising lens would sharpen the sky up too ?</td>', 'great, but could do with being under exposed a stop or so to bring out the lemon and sky colours - maybe a polarising lens would sharpen the sky up too ?', '2002-09-15 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120094, 5516, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo. You have captured very nice detail on the lemon, and the droplet of water looks great! I also think you picked a great day to shoot, as the sky is just perfect! I think to make it a better shot however, the lemon should be a brighter yellow, because at the moment it looks a bit dull. Maybe some different lighting would help this issue a bit? Besides that I think this is a great photo!<br/>8<br/>Konador</td>', 'Great photo. You have captured very nice detail on the lemon, and the droplet of water looks great! I also think you picked a great day to shoot, as the sky is just perfect! I think to make it a better shot however, the lemon should be a brighter yellow, because at the moment it looks a bit dull. Maybe some different lighting would help this issue a bit? Besides that I think this is a great photo!8Konador', '2002-09-15 05:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120095, 5516, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. A lot of photos this week have similar elements, eg. the backlighting, the drops of water, the sky background. But they mesh so well in this photo. One of my 10s - lisae</td>', 'Very beautiful. A lot of photos this week have similar elements, eg. the backlighting, the drops of water, the sky background. But they mesh so well in this photo. One of my 10s - lisae', '2002-09-15 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120096, 5516, 3136, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, focus, idea.....this is a great shot!</td>', 'lovely colors, focus, idea.....this is a great shot!', '2002-09-15 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120097, 5516, 2, '<td valign="top">CONNNGRATS!!!  A well-deserved score.  Great shot.</td>', 'CONNNGRATS!!!  A well-deserved score.  Great shot.', '2002-09-16 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
