(120105, 5516, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good job.  If it wasn''t for that setzler guy showing off again you would be first!!  :''-D<br/><br/>ps:  Just kidding, John!</td>', 'Good job.  If it wasn''t for that setzler guy showing off again you would be first!!  :''-Dps:  Just kidding, John!', '2002-09-17 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(120106, 5517, 107, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the black and white adds much to this picture.  perhaps if there was abit more contrast, it would add to it, but as it stands, the picture just seems to flow, with no particular interest in any one place.  I don''t think the onion stands out enough.  GOod creativity and idea though.</td>', 'I''m not sure the black and white adds much to this picture.  perhaps if there was abit more contrast, it would add to it, but as it stands, the picture just seems to flow, with no particular interest in any one place.  I don''t think the onion stands out enough.  GOod creativity and idea though.', '2002-09-09 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120107, 5517, 3672, '<td valign="top">I like the use of contrasting colors.</td>', 'I like the use of contrasting colors.', '2002-09-10 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
