(120111, 5517, 2553, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot.  It doesn''t "wow" me, but then again I wouldn''t rule out framing it and hanging it on my kitchen wall.  I like the lighting and composition. lhall-7</td>', 'A very nice shot.  It doesn''t "wow" me, but then again I wouldn''t rule out framing it and hanging it on my kitchen wall.  I like the lighting and composition. lhall-7', '2002-09-10 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
