(120115, 5517, 2344, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you get a lot of complaints about "Fruits and Veggies should be in COLOUR" Well I love this picture. There really isn''t anything wrong with it except you''re crowding the edges of your picture. Leave just a little more room around the sides and you''ll be better off. My favourite this week 10-BigSmiles</td>', 'I''ll bet you get a lot of complaints about "Fruits and Veggies should be in COLOUR" Well I love this picture. There really isn''t anything wrong with it except you''re crowding the edges of your picture. Leave just a little more room around the sides and you''ll be better off. My favourite this week 10-BigSmiles', '2002-09-13 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
