(120130, 5518, 2829, '<td valign="top">And yet again another person shooting with a flash...bad bad bad! Don''t shoot with a flash directly at the reflective items. You get flash flair. Either make a home made diffuser (a plastic one gallon milk container) or use a sheet of white paper or something that''s sort of transparent to achieve soft light that covers the items evenly.</td>', 'And yet again another person shooting with a flash...bad bad bad! Don''t shoot with a flash directly at the reflective items. You get flash flair. Either make a home made diffuser (a plastic one gallon milk container) or use a sheet of white paper or something that''s sort of transparent to achieve soft light that covers the items evenly.', '2002-09-14 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
