(120205, 5522, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!  I think the slice is from a grapefruit, but what is the stuff surrounding the rind?  Very bizarre, unique shot, I like it!  9 Swash</td>', 'Very cool image!  I think the slice is from a grapefruit, but what is the stuff surrounding the rind?  Very bizarre, unique shot, I like it!  9 Swash', '2002-09-10 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120206, 5522, 3213, '<td valign="top">This is a very good and creative idea. I can tell there is a slice of orange in there simulating the egg, and I think the "sperms" are granate seeds, or grape seeds?? The lighting is great, which gives different shades of reds and brings out the different textures. What''s the background? I can''t tell. But let me tell you something, I can see the reflection of your camera''s lens at the middle of the orange, was it because of the use of a glass at the top of everything?? <br/>Very interesting and creative shot. I liked it a lot. Good luck! 9.</td>', 'This is a very good and creative idea. I can tell there is a slice of orange in there simulating the egg, and I think the "sperms" are granate seeds, or grape seeds?? The lighting is great, which gives different shades of reds and brings out the different textures. What''s the background? I can''t tell. But let me tell you something, I can see the reflection of your camera''s lens at the middle of the orange, was it because of the use of a glass at the top of everything?? Very interesting and creative shot. I liked it a lot. Good luck! 9.', '2002-09-10 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
