(120285, 5528, 806, '<td valign="top">you have succeeded in making this look round. This was a difficult task, imo, in this challenge. A lot of times, the lighting can make the fruit look flat. Nice work.</td>', 'you have succeeded in making this look round. This was a difficult task, imo, in this challenge. A lot of times, the lighting can make the fruit look flat. Nice work.', '2002-09-10 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
