(120288, 5528, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Subject matter is good.  Focus and lighting are good.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Subject matter is good.  Focus and lighting are good.', '2002-09-11 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
