(120330, 5533, 1, '<td valign="top">Very appealing, great colors.  I think the composure could''ve been a bit better though.  More DOF to focus in all of the tomato would''ve been nice too.<br/></td>', 'Very appealing, great colors.  I think the composure could''ve been a bit better though.  More DOF to focus in all of the tomato would''ve been nice too.', '2002-09-14 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
