(120334, 5534, 3354, '<td valign="top">At first this image didn''t grasp me. But after I watched it for awhile, I really liked the starkness of straight edge of the wood when compared with the fuzzy round edge of the apple. Very nice. - phlebotiss</td>', 'At first this image didn''t grasp me. But after I watched it for awhile, I really liked the starkness of straight edge of the wood when compared with the fuzzy round edge of the apple. Very nice. - phlebotiss', '2002-09-09 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
