(120362, 5535, 312, '<td valign="top">very simple and very elegantly done. good use of negative space and black and white. i think a tad more light could have helped this, as it loses a bit of detail in the shadows. it might have helped to give it a tonal range. 7.</td>', 'very simple and very elegantly done. good use of negative space and black and white. i think a tad more light could have helped this, as it loses a bit of detail in the shadows. it might have helped to give it a tonal range. 7.', '2002-09-13 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120363, 5535, 2781, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better in color.  It would give more pop to the picture.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better in color.  It would give more pop to the picture.', '2002-09-13 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
