(120393, 5539, 3018, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but be careful with the light and shadows.  Also watch the sharpening filter you applied (look at the halos created on the edges of the apples).  I would have liked another light source from the right.  I think your idea is great, and the use of the mirror and sky is terrific.</td>', 'Great idea, but be careful with the light and shadows.  Also watch the sharpening filter you applied (look at the halos created on the edges of the apples).  I would have liked another light source from the right.  I think your idea is great, and the use of the mirror and sky is terrific.', '2002-09-09 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120394, 5539, 2798, '<td valign="top">Beautifully simple. Love the colours. Could maybe have used a little filler light from the right. But that''s just a nit pick. 9 - floyd</td>', 'Beautifully simple. Love the colours. Could maybe have used a little filler light from the right. But that''s just a nit pick. 9 - floyd', '2002-09-09 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
