(120431, 5541, 1041, '<td valign="top">great idea, especially with the reflection being the focal point of your photo, unfortunately, everything seems out of focus, there''s nothing my eyes can rest on. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'great idea, especially with the reflection being the focal point of your photo, unfortunately, everything seems out of focus, there''s nothing my eyes can rest on. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-09 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
