(120438, 5541, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition -  good<br/>Technical Aspects - fair<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  fair<br/>Other suggestions  looks under exposed, except for the candle, and a tad blurred<br/>A 4<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition -  goodTechnical Aspects - fairMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  fairOther suggestions  looks under exposed, except for the candle, and a tad blurredA 4Jim msp', '2002-09-10 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
