(120440, 5541, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating4.   Autool<br/>If you had shot this with a tripod or some type of camers support I could have rated it much higher.   It looks both underexposed and blured from camera movement.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating4.   AutoolIf you had shot this with a tripod or some type of camers support I could have rated it much higher.   It looks both underexposed and blured from camera movement.', '2002-09-11 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
