(120448, 5541, 806, '<td valign="top">Since this was a low light condition, you probably had to set a slow shutter speed. Try using a tripod, or if you don''t have one, rest the camera on a level and sturdy surface. This will bring your subject into better focus.</td>', 'Since this was a low light condition, you probably had to set a slow shutter speed. Try using a tripod, or if you don''t have one, rest the camera on a level and sturdy surface. This will bring your subject into better focus.', '2002-09-14 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
