(120512, 5547, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good trick with the title :)  I like the way you have layed out the fruit on top of the  collumn, but I think it needs something else on the right hand side, to sort of balance the picture out. You''ve got a nice angle on the column aswell, and i really like the drops on the tomatos. One thing i''m not too keen on in this photo is the background. It looks like you''ve used a sheet, because I can see places where it is raised up, and I think it kinda takes away alot of the clarity that the column creates. Also, the top left looks very blown out.<br/>7<br/>Konador</td>', 'Good trick with the title :)  I like the way you have layed out the fruit on top of the  collumn, but I think it needs something else on the right hand side, to sort of balance the picture out. You''ve got a nice angle on the column aswell, and i really like the drops on the tomatos. One thing i''m not too keen on in this photo is the background. It looks like you''ve used a sheet, because I can see places where it is raised up, and I think it kinda takes away alot of the clarity that the column creates. Also, the top left looks very blown out.7Konador', '2002-09-14 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
