(120620, 5551, 2158, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really fit the challenge.  One can''t really see what fruit she''s eating.</td>', 'Doesn''t really fit the challenge.  One can''t really see what fruit she''s eating.', '2002-09-09 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120621, 5551, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a cute shot... the catch light in her eyes is very nice also... this shot is definitely a keeper.  I also like the fact that she is distracted from the camera and not looking at it directly.  That adds quite a bit of impact to this photo.  As for meeting the challenge, it does becuase i can see the fruit.  Meeting the challenge effectively?  I would like to see more fruit or more of the fruit that exists in this photo.  The fruit/veggie concept could be stronger if the fruit/veggie was displayed in a unique way.  I don''t use the ''word'' anymore, but I expected to see more shots similar to this in the challenge, and this is a nicely done version of the concept.  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a cute shot... the catch light in her eyes is very nice also... this shot is definitely a keeper.  I also like the fact that she is distracted from the camera and not looking at it directly.  That adds quite a bit of impact to this photo.  As for meeting the challenge, it does becuase i can see the fruit.  Meeting the challenge effectively?  I would like to see more fruit or more of the fruit that exists in this photo.  The fruit/veggie concept could be stronger if the fruit/veggie was displayed in a unique way.  I don''t use the ''word'' anymore, but I expected to see more shots similar to this in the challenge, and this is a nicely done version of the concept.  - jmsetzler', '2002-09-10 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120622, 5551, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great sharp focus. good expsoure. desaturation works. odd glazed expression tho</td>', 'Great sharp focus. good expsoure. desaturation works. odd glazed expression tho', '2002-09-11 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120623, 5551, 2928, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait.  Some may say the colour is a bit washed out, but I happen to like the natural effect within the composition; it allows the entire image to blend well and highlights the child''s features to perfection.  I can''t knock this shot at all, and the only possible suggestion to improve the shot could also ruin it; but a huge red apple to add contrast may have looked great  but it may not.  I''ll leave that one for you to decide. Great shot (9)</td>', 'Fantastic portrait.  Some may say the colour is a bit washed out, but I happen to like the natural effect within the composition; it allows the entire image to blend well and highlights the child''s features to perfection.  I can''t knock this shot at all, and the only possible suggestion to improve the shot could also ruin it; but a huge red apple to add contrast may have looked great  but it may not.  I''ll leave that one for you to decide. Great shot (9)', '2002-09-11 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120624, 5551, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait..the color is a plus..nothing negative with this . (9)</td>', 'lovely portrait..the color is a plus..nothing negative with this . (9)', '2002-09-11 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120625, 5551, 2667, '<td valign="top">i really like the porcelain tone of this shot. This baby looks freshly awakened and slightly zoned. I like the placement of her hands on the fruit. All the lines in the picture, her hands, the roundness of the back of the chair...the composition of the shot all lead to her eyes.Sweet shot. (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'i really like the porcelain tone of this shot. This baby looks freshly awakened and slightly zoned. I like the placement of her hands on the fruit. All the lines in the picture, her hands, the roundness of the back of the chair...the composition of the shot all lead to her eyes.Sweet shot. (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-13 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120626, 5551, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-14 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
