(120637, 5552, 2667, '<td valign="top">brilliant color! and the composition is very well maintained with so many visible elements, which is tough to do. my only real critique would be the depth of field, i wish it had been maintained beyond the red bells to the yellow bells--they seem soft and somewhat blended together. also, i do wish the plastic bag in the back had been removed, but it doesn''t affect my score. great shot.  (8) ~mcmurma</td>', 'brilliant color! and the composition is very well maintained with so many visible elements, which is tough to do. my only real critique would be the depth of field, i wish it had been maintained beyond the red bells to the yellow bells--they seem soft and somewhat blended together. also, i do wish the plastic bag in the back had been removed, but it doesn''t affect my score. great shot.  (8) ~mcmurma', '2002-09-09 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
