(120644, 5552, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I like the "marketplace" look and feel.  The lighting and composition work for me with one exception - The cellophane bags in the upper left hand corner keep drawing my eyes up there.  I think I would have liked the shot better without those bags, however, I realize that removing them was most likely not an option!! lhall-8</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I like the "marketplace" look and feel.  The lighting and composition work for me with one exception - The cellophane bags in the upper left hand corner keep drawing my eyes up there.  I think I would have liked the shot better without those bags, however, I realize that removing them was most likely not an option!! lhall-8', '2002-09-10 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
