(120658, 5552, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this, not exactly a rainbow but I know what you mean :P There are a lot of nice vibrant colours here and you''ve captured them quite well. The foreground seems very good, and is in nice focus, but everything nearer the back (top) of the photo seems to be out of focus. To get around this you could set your camera to a wider DOF, if that is an option on your camera, unfortunatly on mine it is not, but if you could do that I think it would improve the photo.<br/>7<br/>Konador</td>', 'I like this, not exactly a rainbow but I know what you mean :P There are a lot of nice vibrant colours here and you''ve captured them quite well. The foreground seems very good, and is in nice focus, but everything nearer the back (top) of the photo seems to be out of focus. To get around this you could set your camera to a wider DOF, if that is an option on your camera, unfortunatly on mine it is not, but if you could do that I think it would improve the photo.7Konador', '2002-09-15 05:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120659, 5552, 2261, '<td valign="top">Nice and colourful.</td>', 'Nice and colourful.', '2002-09-15 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120660, 5553, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good color, but the background is on the dark side, the apple motion (blur) doesn''t help the photo and the pickle is way dark.  Crop out the fruit and background and you have a really nice photo of the boy.  7 Swash</td>', 'Good color, but the background is on the dark side, the apple motion (blur) doesn''t help the photo and the pickle is way dark.  Crop out the fruit and background and you have a really nice photo of the boy.  7 Swash', '2002-09-09 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
