(120692, 5555, 3080, '<td valign="top">This isn''t too terribly exciting, however, it''s great reality.  I do like the splashes of water, and the color of the apple is yummy.  I wish there had been more light on the apple, however, I have the feeling if there were, then the glare on the sink would be distracting.  Overall nice photo.   Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'This isn''t too terribly exciting, however, it''s great reality.  I do like the splashes of water, and the color of the apple is yummy.  I wish there had been more light on the apple, however, I have the feeling if there were, then the glare on the sink would be distracting.  Overall nice photo.   Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120693, 5555, 3294, '<td valign="top">Very interesting colors.  The aluminum really adds to the composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very interesting colors.  The aluminum really adds to the composition.  Nicely done.', '2002-09-11 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
