(120717, 5557, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice white background. I don''t know why they tried to DQ this. It is obvious it is a photo of a print out. Anyway, I like the use of the green apple. Granny Smith seems to feel more old fashioned with an old fashioned message/proverb. Looking for the apple to be a bit more round looking, as it looks a bit flat due to the use of lighting, and could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice white background. I don''t know why they tried to DQ this. It is obvious it is a photo of a print out. Anyway, I like the use of the green apple. Granny Smith seems to feel more old fashioned with an old fashioned message/proverb. Looking for the apple to be a bit more round looking, as it looks a bit flat due to the use of lighting, and could be a bit sharper.', '2002-09-10 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
