(120749, 5559, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like the fence and the way it leads you to the cornstalk.</td>', 'I really like the fence and the way it leads you to the cornstalk.', '2002-09-09 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120750, 5559, 637, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how i''d improve this image, cuz i don''t think a single stalk of corn is very attractive.  The fence doesn''t help at all; neither do the weeds or dead plants along the fence.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'I don''t know how i''d improve this image, cuz i don''t think a single stalk of corn is very attractive.  The fence doesn''t help at all; neither do the weeds or dead plants along the fence.  4 sjgleah', '2002-09-09 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120751, 5559, 3672, '<td valign="top">The fence seems to pull me away from your subject.</td>', 'The fence seems to pull me away from your subject.', '2002-09-10 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120752, 5559, 1041, '<td valign="top">it is a little lonely, isn''t it, especially with the dried plants around it.  i think you have a really good idea here, i was in minnesota last week and just didn''t get the time to take a photo of corn in a field, but i thought about it.  you have a nice fence in the background, and i wonder what your photo would look like if you zoomed in and focused on the corn itself and that way eliminated some of the background that doesn''t need to be there.  just a thought. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'it is a little lonely, isn''t it, especially with the dried plants around it.  i think you have a really good idea here, i was in minnesota last week and just didn''t get the time to take a photo of corn in a field, but i thought about it.  you have a nice fence in the background, and i wonder what your photo would look like if you zoomed in and focused on the corn itself and that way eliminated some of the background that doesn''t need to be there.  just a thought. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-10 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120753, 5559, 772, '<td valign="top">The color and contrast in this photo is very nice, as is the depth of field... The silk haning from the cornstalk is also a nice element of this photo...  - jmsetzler</td>', 'The color and contrast in this photo is very nice, as is the depth of field... The silk haning from the cornstalk is also a nice element of this photo...  - jmsetzler', '2002-09-10 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
