(120788, 5561, 3524, '<td valign="top">This is a beauty. Great lighting. The color and deep shadows in the fruit pop perfectly against the neutral, hi-key background items. Incredibly balanced composition. My eye hits that deep blushing peach, and then the grapes and stalks of grain take me to focus on the bright yellow-green apple, and then wander up to the delicate flowers which point me back down to the bowl with the peach. Wow. (10) -Jeremy</td>', 'This is a beauty. Great lighting. The color and deep shadows in the fruit pop perfectly against the neutral, hi-key background items. Incredibly balanced composition. My eye hits that deep blushing peach, and then the grapes and stalks of grain take me to focus on the bright yellow-green apple, and then wander up to the delicate flowers which point me back down to the bowl with the peach. Wow. (10) -Jeremy', '2002-09-11 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120789, 5561, 133, '<td valign="top">Very appealing visually.</td>', 'Very appealing visually.', '2002-09-11 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120790, 5561, 637, '<td valign="top">Hard to think of it as a still life when it is so cluttered.  I would like to see the fruitbowl and the plate in front as the only two components of this image.  5 sjgleah</td>', 'Hard to think of it as a still life when it is so cluttered.  I would like to see the fruitbowl and the plate in front as the only two components of this image.  5 sjgleah', '2002-09-12 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120791, 5561, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a classic.  It is a superbly constructed still life.  The use of balanced colours and textures give the shot a relaxed rather than cluttered feel.  It also uses the classic triangle placement which gives the shot equilibrium of subjects, thus making easy to look at.  The lighting in this shot is also perfect, as is the angle the shot was taken. The mixed, but carefully placed objects, are made interesting by this really superb example of perfect, and highly professional, composition.  You should do a tutorial based around this shot after the challenge (and I''m not joking) (10+++)</td>', 'This is a classic.  It is a superbly constructed still life.  The use of balanced colours and textures give the shot a relaxed rather than cluttered feel.  It also uses the classic triangle placement which gives the shot equilibrium of subjects, thus making easy to look at.  The lighting in this shot is also perfect, as is the angle the shot was taken. The mixed, but carefully placed objects, are made interesting by this really superb example of perfect, and highly professional, composition.  You should do a tutorial based around this shot after the challenge (and I''m not joking) (10+++)', '2002-09-12 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
