(120797, 5561, 2997, '<td valign="top">This is a very well-arranged setting.  The picture is sharp and pleasant to the eye..  I could see this being a posterboard picture in a kitchen.<br/>One small detail: The shadows cast on the wall a bit distracting.  Another lamp providing light to hide that would have greatly complimented this picture.</td>', 'This is a very well-arranged setting.  The picture is sharp and pleasant to the eye..  I could see this being a posterboard picture in a kitchen.One small detail: The shadows cast on the wall a bit distracting.  Another lamp providing light to hide that would have greatly complimented this picture.', '2002-09-13 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120798, 5561, 3575, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this creation. It is a genuine piece of art. I would have given you a 10 but for the cropping. I''m sure you couldn''t help it to have the correct size for the challenge but If each element was complete in the photo, it would have been perfect (after you take the little crum specs off the table with your editor). It is just so beautifully country and fresh and warm. The more I look at this the more things I like, for example, it was inspred to place the weeds on top of the fruit bowl in front. The placemat could have so easily been distracting but you placed it in so that it is not. This is in my top 3. - joanns (9+)</td>', 'I absolutely love this creation. It is a genuine piece of art. I would have given you a 10 but for the cropping. I''m sure you couldn''t help it to have the correct size for the challenge but If each element was complete in the photo, it would have been perfect (after you take the little crum specs off the table with your editor). It is just so beautifully country and fresh and warm. The more I look at this the more things I like, for example, it was inspred to place the weeds on top of the fruit bowl in front. The placemat could have so easily been distracting but you placed it in so that it is not. This is in my top 3. - joanns (9+)', '2002-09-13 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
