(120856, 5563, 1897, '<td valign="top">Since I work for Intel, I should give this a one.<br/><br/>I like the composition.  Did you play with your focal point?  I can see why you wanted the Apple logo in focus, but focussing the the real apples, and using a small aperature may have kept everything in focus.  6</td>', 'Since I work for Intel, I should give this a one.I like the composition.  Did you play with your focal point?  I can see why you wanted the Apple logo in focus, but focussing the the real apples, and using a small aperature may have kept everything in focus.  6', '2002-09-12 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120857, 5563, 1128, '<td valign="top">What a great title!  Made me laugh out loud.  This is a very clever concept and I like that there are different types of apples.</td>', 'What a great title!  Made me laugh out loud.  This is a very clever concept and I like that there are different types of apples.', '2002-09-14 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120858, 5563, 3903, '<td valign="top">no comment</td>', 'no comment', '2002-09-14 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120859, 5563, 2199, '<td valign="top">I love Macintosh computers (using Mac OS X right now!)...and this is a very creative idea for a photograph. I might like the composition a bit more if the ''real'' apples were not dividing the frame so close to the middle. Maybe a perspective shot that was further away from the fruit, looking up to the computer in the background. LanSnake</td>', 'I love Macintosh computers (using Mac OS X right now!)...and this is a very creative idea for a photograph. I might like the composition a bit more if the ''real'' apples were not dividing the frame so close to the middle. Maybe a perspective shot that was further away from the fruit, looking up to the computer in the background. LanSnake', '2002-09-15 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120860, 5565, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the color variation between the foreground and the background. would be better if the blue extended through the shot, but I understand why it doesn''t. Still a very good pic.</td>', 'I like the color variation between the foreground and the background. would be better if the blue extended through the shot, but I understand why it doesn''t. Still a very good pic.', '2002-09-09 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
