(120870, 5565, 1280, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharply focused.     A slightly different angle may have worked better by not having the tomatoes dead center.  Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce</td>', 'Not quite sharply focused.     A slightly different angle may have worked better by not having the tomatoes dead center.  Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce', '2002-09-14 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120871, 5565, 3903, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-09-14 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120872, 5565, 1826, '<td valign="top">Good job. If you crop this a bit on the left, it moves the subject off center and puts more of an emphasis on that diagonal stem line. Great DOF.</td>', 'Good job. If you crop this a bit on the left, it moves the subject off center and puts more of an emphasis on that diagonal stem line. Great DOF.', '2002-09-15 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120873, 5565, 509, '<td valign="top">Is this on a beach?  I like the blue background.  If it is on a beach, it might benefit the picture to show some more of the sand, to give it a more tropical feel.  Overall though, the technical details are great.  The depth of field is also a plus.  I think the green color is a little bland, but otherwise I really like this one. - 9 - Mav</td>', 'Is this on a beach?  I like the blue background.  If it is on a beach, it might benefit the picture to show some more of the sand, to give it a more tropical feel.  Overall though, the technical details are great.  The depth of field is also a plus.  I think the green color is a little bland, but otherwise I really like this one. - 9 - Mav', '2002-09-15 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120874, 5566, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Love the bubbles.  I would like to have seen a more dynamic composition - the lime seems to sit dead center, and while I believe in breaking "rules", in this case it doesn''t work for me that well. lhall-7</td>', 'Cool!  Love the bubbles.  I would like to have seen a more dynamic composition - the lime seems to sit dead center, and while I believe in breaking "rules", in this case it doesn''t work for me that well. lhall-7', '2002-09-09 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120875, 5566, 3280, '<td valign="top">I can feel the fizz!  Good enought to drink!</td>', 'I can feel the fizz!  Good enought to drink!', '2002-09-10 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120876, 5566, 3294, '<td valign="top">*hiccup!*  Nice shot!  *hiccup!*  :D</td>', '*hiccup!*  Nice shot!  *hiccup!*  :D', '2002-09-10 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120877, 5566, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very nice. You can just feel how cold this is.</td>', 'Very nice. You can just feel how cold this is.', '2002-09-10 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120878, 5566, 2928, '<td valign="top">Another really well thought out and superbly executed shot. The composition is first class and the achieved effect is mouth wateringly good.  Terrific use of macro and lighting.  Overall, the shot leaps out and is punctuated by making the viewer  me in this case  become fanciful of a Gin and Tonic (10)</td>', 'Another really well thought out and superbly executed shot. The composition is first class and the achieved effect is mouth wateringly good.  Terrific use of macro and lighting.  Overall, the shot leaps out and is punctuated by making the viewer  me in this case  become fanciful of a Gin and Tonic (10)', '2002-09-11 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120879, 5566, 133, '<td valign="top">Love the close up of the bubbles.</td>', 'Love the close up of the bubbles.', '2002-09-11 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120880, 5566, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus, Love the bubbles. Something lacking in the composition for me, but a great shot nonetheless. 7 ~indigo997</td>', 'Nice sharp focus, Love the bubbles. Something lacking in the composition for me, but a great shot nonetheless. 7 ~indigo997', '2002-09-11 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120881, 5566, 3317, '<td valign="top">gave the strawberries one a ten, you get a nine, only difference is the splash, tough to beat.</td>', 'gave the strawberries one a ten, you get a nine, only difference is the splash, tough to beat.', '2002-09-12 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120882, 5566, 1325, '<td valign="top">This is not what your mama had in mind when she told you to eat your vegetables.</td>', 'This is not what your mama had in mind when she told you to eat your vegetables.', '2002-09-12 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120883, 5566, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fruit and bubbly water, great combo!  Good color, framing works, but I think I would have filled the glass less, and skipped the glass rim.  9 Swash</td>', 'Fruit and bubbly water, great combo!  Good color, framing works, but I think I would have filled the glass less, and skipped the glass rim.  9 Swash', '2002-09-12 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120884, 5566, 3087, '<td valign="top">7, Kavey</td>', '7, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120885, 5566, 2997, '<td valign="top">Well-centered.  Good lighting.  The only thing I may have tried different is the background color.</td>', 'Well-centered.  Good lighting.  The only thing I may have tried different is the background color.', '2002-09-13 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120886, 5566, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice macro shot... the detail is quite excellent... I would have loved to see some of the side of the lime slice in this glass.. I''m not sure how difficult that may have been... good shot :) - 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very nice macro shot... the detail is quite excellent... I would have loved to see some of the side of the lime slice in this glass.. I''m not sure how difficult that may have been... good shot :) - 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-13 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120887, 5566, 1897, '<td valign="top">Make a nice print to put up over the bar, good work.</td>', 'Make a nice print to put up over the bar, good work.', '2002-09-13 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120888, 5566, 3578, '<td valign="top">It seems a little faded... try changing the contrast a little bit. 8.</td>', 'It seems a little faded... try changing the contrast a little bit. 8.', '2002-09-13 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120889, 5566, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good shot, very detailed bubbles.  I can taste the beverage.  The only thing that I would like better in the photo is to see more than just the rind of the lime.</td>', 'Good shot, very detailed bubbles.  I can taste the beverage.  The only thing that I would like better in the photo is to see more than just the rind of the lime.', '2002-09-13 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
