(120948, 5569, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. The composition is stunning, and the way the light catches that water, especially the little red reflected highlights from the strawberry, is divine. It makes me thirsty! I''m giving this 10 - lisae</td>', 'Very beautiful. The composition is stunning, and the way the light catches that water, especially the little red reflected highlights from the strawberry, is divine. It makes me thirsty! I''m giving this 10 - lisae', '2002-09-12 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120949, 5569, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good water action!  I have discovered (via my own submission) that water makes some fruit appear gooey or slimey (I know, it''s the water).  No points either way, can''t fight physics!  Speaking of physics, is the water being blown or did you change the angle of the photo?  (water should flow down, not across)  Very nice framing, love the glare on the water.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice.  Good water action!  I have discovered (via my own submission) that water makes some fruit appear gooey or slimey (I know, it''s the water).  No points either way, can''t fight physics!  Speaking of physics, is the water being blown or did you change the angle of the photo?  (water should flow down, not across)  Very nice framing, love the glare on the water.  9 Swash', '2002-09-12 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(120950, 5569, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moving water, great colour in the strawberry (looks juicy!). However, I do wish the background was a little lighter so that the water on the bottom half stood out more. Nice job overall, though.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moving water, great colour in the strawberry (looks juicy!). However, I do wish the background was a little lighter so that the water on the bottom half stood out more. Nice job overall, though.', '2002-09-12 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
