(121063, 5574, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great color and contrast.</td>', 'Great color and contrast.', '2002-09-09 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121064, 5574, 1189, '<td valign="top">very simple and good looking, would have liked to see the black blacker, if you know what I mean.</td>', 'very simple and good looking, would have liked to see the black blacker, if you know what I mean.', '2002-09-10 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121065, 5574, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the "lost edges" and the negative space, but I think the composition could be a little more dynamic - I really prefer odd numbers of things, and in this case am not crazy about the "centering" of the apples.  lhall-7</td>', 'I like the "lost edges" and the negative space, but I think the composition could be a little more dynamic - I really prefer odd numbers of things, and in this case am not crazy about the "centering" of the apples.  lhall-7', '2002-09-11 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121066, 5574, 258, '<td valign="top">focus?</td>', 'focus?', '2002-09-11 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121067, 5574, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot.  But, I can see a tiny flaw with the composition.  The main subject is perhaps a little to central in my opinion.  I think that off-setting the fruit, to the right and down in this case, would weaken the strength of the slightly overpowering background and boost the central subject. This is only my opinion.  I love the way the apples blend into the darkness on the left edge, but there is a slight glare on the apple skin.  Try bouncing or diffusing the light source in some way That said, it might sound like I don''t like the shot  on the contrary, I think it''s a great shot (8)</td>', 'This is a good shot.  But, I can see a tiny flaw with the composition.  The main subject is perhaps a little to central in my opinion.  I think that off-setting the fruit, to the right and down in this case, would weaken the strength of the slightly overpowering background and boost the central subject. This is only my opinion.  I love the way the apples blend into the darkness on the left edge, but there is a slight glare on the apple skin.  Try bouncing or diffusing the light source in some way That said, it might sound like I don''t like the shot  on the contrary, I think it''s a great shot (8)', '2002-09-12 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121068, 5574, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice set up shot.  Moderately low interest.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice set up shot.  Moderately low interest.  8 Swash', '2002-09-12 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121069, 5574, 3087, '<td valign="top">6, Kavey</td>', '6, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121070, 5574, 811, '<td valign="top">Good detail and i like the shadows on the apples.  The only minor (very minor) nit is that you can see the texture of your background.  Without that, it would look like the apples were suspended. karmat</td>', 'Good detail and i like the shadows on the apples.  The only minor (very minor) nit is that you can see the texture of your background.  Without that, it would look like the apples were suspended. karmat', '2002-09-13 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
