(121072, 5574, 1280, '<td valign="top">good color and contrast.  Background helps this image to pop.  The focus is a little soft.  OVer all good!  Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce</td>', 'good color and contrast.  Background helps this image to pop.  The focus is a little soft.  OVer all good!  Good luck in the callenge.  Gracious aka Grayce', '2002-09-14 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
