(121093, 5576, 1066, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro shot...I have done dozens of lifestyle ads in my work and this is the kind of shot I like to use...a littel more depth of field on the lighted part of the corn (maybe 5%) would have made this perfect..still..beautiful..9..hokie</td>', 'Wonderful macro shot...I have done dozens of lifestyle ads in my work and this is the kind of shot I like to use...a littel more depth of field on the lighted part of the corn (maybe 5%) would have made this perfect..still..beautiful..9..hokie', '2002-09-11 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
