(121119, 5577, 3280, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t like the "science fiction" photos but then this is better than most.  The Kohlorabi (?) on the right sure looks like an alien spaceship!!  Nice job.</td>', 'I generally don''t like the "science fiction" photos but then this is better than most.  The Kohlorabi (?) on the right sure looks like an alien spaceship!!  Nice job.', '2002-09-09 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121120, 5577, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative.  I like what you''ve done here.  Focus is good.  Lighting is excellent.  Subject matter is outstanding.  9</td>', 'Very imaginative.  I like what you''ve done here.  Focus is good.  Lighting is excellent.  Subject matter is outstanding.  9', '2002-09-09 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
