(121123, 5577, 2667, '<td valign="top">you have rich color and texture in this shot...and then dull grey plastic that draws the focus away from the inventive use of the veg....image would have been much stronger without the plastic, imo. Revised: really do love the texture here, keep coming back...how about if one of your asparagus "trees" falls down on top of that plastic...the eye could go further into the landscape...hmmm, bumping this up 2 points (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'you have rich color and texture in this shot...and then dull grey plastic that draws the focus away from the inventive use of the veg....image would have been much stronger without the plastic, imo. Revised: really do love the texture here, keep coming back...how about if one of your asparagus "trees" falls down on top of that plastic...the eye could go further into the landscape...hmmm, bumping this up 2 points (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-09 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121124, 5577, 1360, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this.  Great imagination!  9 -lennier</td>', 'I LOVE this.  Great imagination!  9 -lennier', '2002-09-09 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
