(121140, 5577, 2928, '<td valign="top">As this shot was loading and prior to reading the title  I thought that it looked like an alien landscape  then I smiled when I looked at the title This is superb, but you should have lost the plastic figure- it kills the effect I was thinking how alien it looked long before the little plastic monstrosity appeared.  Right, having blotted out the plastic thing  this is a really well taken and superbly composed shot.  You have achieved you objective with aplomb; first class picture  plastic thing not withstanding With little creature (5) Without plastic thing (10++)  Compromise on creative use the camera and outstanding shooting  (9)</td>', 'As this shot was loading and prior to reading the title  I thought that it looked like an alien landscape  then I smiled when I looked at the title This is superb, but you should have lost the plastic figure- it kills the effect I was thinking how alien it looked long before the little plastic monstrosity appeared.  Right, having blotted out the plastic thing  this is a really well taken and superbly composed shot.  You have achieved you objective with aplomb; first class picture  plastic thing not withstanding With little creature (5) Without plastic thing (10++)  Compromise on creative use the camera and outstanding shooting  (9)', '2002-09-11 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
