(121193, 5579, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fruit and bubbly water, can''t go wrong!  Very nice.  I think I just realized the title meaning (I was thinking splash as descriptive, not active)  The rear strawberry had just "jumped in", right?  Very cool idea, but it didn''t translate into still as well.  I only really "got it" when I tried to figure out why the rear strawberry didn''t have bubbles on it.  Great shot either way!  9 Swash</td>', 'Fruit and bubbly water, can''t go wrong!  Very nice.  I think I just realized the title meaning (I was thinking splash as descriptive, not active)  The rear strawberry had just "jumped in", right?  Very cool idea, but it didn''t translate into still as well.  I only really "got it" when I tried to figure out why the rear strawberry didn''t have bubbles on it.  Great shot either way!  9 Swash', '2002-09-12 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
