(121197, 5579, 312, '<td valign="top">very nicely done. the only thing that bothers me about this shot is the very muted color range. i feel like the whites need to be whiter and the reds need to pop more. maybe a bit more light would have helped it accomplish this. but it''s a nicely executed shot nonetheless. 8.</td>', 'very nicely done. the only thing that bothers me about this shot is the very muted color range. i feel like the whites need to be whiter and the reds need to pop more. maybe a bit more light would have helped it accomplish this. but it''s a nicely executed shot nonetheless. 8.', '2002-09-13 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
