(121211, 5579, 1066, '<td valign="top">My only real regret with this shot was not getting the background white enough and not getting the splash bigger.  I thought about a black background but I felt it lost that "Sparkly and Fresh" feel I wanted to project.<br/><br/>I am new with stop action and it was a trip trying ot do it with a slow reacting digicam!  Just trying to explore as many techniques as I can :-)</td>', 'My only real regret with this shot was not getting the background white enough and not getting the splash bigger.  I thought about a black background but I felt it lost that "Sparkly and Fresh" feel I wanted to project.I am new with stop action and it was a trip trying ot do it with a slow reacting digicam!  Just trying to explore as many techniques as I can :-)', '2002-09-16 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(121212, 5579, 3361, '<td valign="top">to fix the background you could have adjusted the brightness/contrast(photoshop) both +10. then, as kind of a different look at the picture, do auto levels. obviously an excellent picture prior to any adjustment</td>', 'to fix the background you could have adjusted the brightness/contrast(photoshop) both +10. then, as kind of a different look at the picture, do auto levels. obviously an excellent picture prior to any adjustment', '2002-09-21 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
