(121234, 5581, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot... I think a vertical orientation may have worked out a little better :)  I''m scoring this one an 8, but i''m concerned abou the little spot in the upper right corner.  This makes me wonder if the background has been edited out.  The reflection under the glass from the glass stem makes me think that this surface is reflective.  It also looks like the camera flash was used to light this shot... this would have lit up a lot more of this surface.... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice shot... I think a vertical orientation may have worked out a little better :)  I''m scoring this one an 8, but i''m concerned abou the little spot in the upper right corner.  This makes me wonder if the background has been edited out.  The reflection under the glass from the glass stem makes me think that this surface is reflective.  It also looks like the camera flash was used to light this shot... this would have lit up a lot more of this surface.... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-11 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
