(121236, 5581, 3575, '<td valign="top">There are so many great photos in this challenge  but yours  is my favorite. I like everything about it. The green liquid and light reflection in the glass, the twin berries (same size) , the angle. And the beauty of simplicity -- you got my 10! Joanns</td>', 'There are so many great photos in this challenge  but yours  is my favorite. I like everything about it. The green liquid and light reflection in the glass, the twin berries (same size) , the angle. And the beauty of simplicity -- you got my 10! Joanns', '2002-09-11 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121237, 5581, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is nice work. the green is to die for. The lighting on the berries is just a little harsh, but may have been needed to attain the green. I love the dark black with the glass. Good Luck 9 Gotcha</td>', 'This is nice work. the green is to die for. The lighting on the berries is just a little harsh, but may have been needed to attain the green. I love the dark black with the glass. Good Luck 9 Gotcha', '2002-09-12 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
