(121240, 5581, 3524, '<td valign="top">I like the concentrated color and glinty contrast in this picture. <br/><br/>For me, the reflections in the green liquid are really competing with the strawberries for attention though. Just a thought, but I wonder if the strawberries had been placed either to the right or left so that the arc of hilights led up to the strawberries, it might pull it together better. Not sure though, just wondering. --JPerez</td>', 'I like the concentrated color and glinty contrast in this picture. For me, the reflections in the green liquid are really competing with the strawberries for attention though. Just a thought, but I wonder if the strawberries had been placed either to the right or left so that the arc of hilights led up to the strawberries, it might pull it together better. Not sure though, just wondering. --JPerez', '2002-09-13 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
