(121308, 5587, 2472, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. Unfortunately the choice of background is very poor, the light is odd and it seems pale. There is even what at least appears to be a cigarret butt in the ground. Atention to details is what makes the difference in a set-up photo.</td>', 'Funny idea. Unfortunately the choice of background is very poor, the light is odd and it seems pale. There is even what at least appears to be a cigarret butt in the ground. Atention to details is what makes the difference in a set-up photo.', '2002-09-09 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121309, 5587, 3672, '<td valign="top">I think you had a cute idea but the cement seems to draw me away from the subjects. I think I would have liked to see the photograph from above the apples in a circle as if perfoming an sombero dance.</td>', 'I think you had a cute idea but the cement seems to draw me away from the subjects. I think I would have liked to see the photograph from above the apples in a circle as if perfoming an sombero dance.', '2002-09-10 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121310, 5587, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is an amusing shot and a superb idea, but it lacks something in terms of overall appeal.  The composition seems a little too centralised, the path edge is distracting and the colour is a little washed out.  I would suggest trying a similar shot with a different background and perhaps trying a number of different angles.  Inside, perhaps with a neutral backdrop Sorry to be so negative</td>', 'This is an amusing shot and a superb idea, but it lacks something in terms of overall appeal.  The composition seems a little too centralised, the path edge is distracting and the colour is a little washed out.  I would suggest trying a similar shot with a different background and perhaps trying a number of different angles.  Inside, perhaps with a neutral backdrop Sorry to be so negative', '2002-09-10 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
