(121319, 5588, 2829, '<td valign="top">Being from NY this photo certainly strikes something with me...I can''t put it in words, as I am sure many others have similar feelings. Simply put, this photo is a 10. I think it''s worthy of being in a museum or in a memorial. Very touching image....</td>', 'Being from NY this photo certainly strikes something with me...I can''t put it in words, as I am sure many others have similar feelings. Simply put, this photo is a 10. I think it''s worthy of being in a museum or in a memorial. Very touching image....', '2002-09-09 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
