(121321, 5588, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is a technically great photo.  Composition, lighting, reflection are awesome.  However, I wish you had left the apple intact.  Though you probably meant this as a tribute, I find the carving of the twin towers to be in poor taste.  Would have been a 9 w/o carving...had it no technical merit, I would vote it a 1.  5 Lisa</td>', 'This is a technically great photo.  Composition, lighting, reflection are awesome.  However, I wish you had left the apple intact.  Though you probably meant this as a tribute, I find the carving of the twin towers to be in poor taste.  Would have been a 9 w/o carving...had it no technical merit, I would vote it a 1.  5 Lisa', '2002-09-09 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121322, 5588, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!  I speaks for itself.  Really no need for words.</td>', 'Excellent!!  I speaks for itself.  Really no need for words.', '2002-09-09 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
