(121327, 5588, 811, '<td valign="top">How approapriate for this week, as well.  Emotions aside, this is a very well composed picture, and I like the reflection at the bottom.  I wish the apple were a touch brighter, though I''m not sure how to tell you to do that. karmat</td>', 'How approapriate for this week, as well.  Emotions aside, this is a very well composed picture, and I like the reflection at the bottom.  I wish the apple were a touch brighter, though I''m not sure how to tell you to do that. karmat', '2002-09-09 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121328, 5588, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool... and timely.  Well done all around.  I''m already curious to see how many anti-American comments you get... but you''ll get a 10 from me.</td>', 'Very cool... and timely.  Well done all around.  I''m already curious to see how many anti-American comments you get... but you''ll get a 10 from me.', '2002-09-09 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121329, 5588, 1041, '<td valign="top">i usually don''t like the play on my emotions of incorporating 9/11 in photos, but you have done a very good job with it, and it fits right into the challenge.  very creative.  the only thing that i would suggest doing differently is excluding the reflection (which i know you put in deliberately) and having lots of negative space ... i know it''s next week''s challenge, but i think that would''ve worked well here. did you try this as a landscape format with negative space? -- gr8photos (7).</td>', 'i usually don''t like the play on my emotions of incorporating 9/11 in photos, but you have done a very good job with it, and it fits right into the challenge.  very creative.  the only thing that i would suggest doing differently is excluding the reflection (which i know you put in deliberately) and having lots of negative space ... i know it''s next week''s challenge, but i think that would''ve worked well here. did you try this as a landscape format with negative space? -- gr8photos (7).', '2002-09-10 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121330, 5588, 772, '<td valign="top">great concept on this photo... This is quite poignant and appealing at the same time... kudos on the originality and the fine execution :) = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'great concept on this photo... This is quite poignant and appealing at the same time... kudos on the originality and the fine execution :) = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-10 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
