(121332, 5588, 3294, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  I might have preferred this shot framed landscape.</td>', 'Very clever.  I might have preferred this shot framed landscape.', '2002-09-10 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121333, 5588, 3546, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea!</td>', 'Very clever idea!', '2002-09-10 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121334, 5588, 51167, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot.  Good timing for this week.  It would have been cool if you''d have done some sort of blue background.  Wow, my wife just gave me some insite on this shot and I like it better now.</td>', 'I liked this shot.  Good timing for this week.  It would have been cool if you''d have done some sort of blue background.  Wow, my wife just gave me some insite on this shot and I like it better now.', '2002-09-10 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121335, 5588, 2183, '<td valign="top">you should sell this pic</td>', 'you should sell this pic', '2002-09-10 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121336, 5588, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have to appologize.  Every time I see something like this I get angry.  Not your fault at all.  I had a friend working on the 93rd floor of WTC1 when it was struck by the plane on the 90th floor, so please don''t get upset if I don''t get all excited about this photo.  I''m not letting that affect my rating however, this is technically well done.  The angle and framing are good, and the focus and clarity are also good.  Lighting fits the photo perfectly.  I like how the white background is broken by the reflection of the apple.  Overall nice photo. Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I have to appologize.  Every time I see something like this I get angry.  Not your fault at all.  I had a friend working on the 93rd floor of WTC1 when it was struck by the plane on the 90th floor, so please don''t get upset if I don''t get all excited about this photo.  I''m not letting that affect my rating however, this is technically well done.  The angle and framing are good, and the focus and clarity are also good.  Lighting fits the photo perfectly.  I like how the white background is broken by the reflection of the apple.  Overall nice photo. Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-10 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121337, 5588, 368, '<td valign="top">very appropriate timing .... nice colors and reflections - god job! Ayme -9<br/></td>', 'very appropriate timing .... nice colors and reflections - god job! Ayme -9', '2002-09-10 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
