(121348, 5588, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really great work.  I admit, at first I was a little put off at this idea, but all in all it is really wonderful work.  The execution is great.  Did you happen to achieve this within a few shots or did you go thru many apples? - noticing that the inside of the apple is not brown :-)  I also like the ever so light shadow/reflection.  Excellent white background.  Excellent work  10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really great work.  I admit, at first I was a little put off at this idea, but all in all it is really wonderful work.  The execution is great.  Did you happen to achieve this within a few shots or did you go thru many apples? - noticing that the inside of the apple is not brown :-)  I also like the ever so light shadow/reflection.  Excellent white background.  Excellent work  10Ruthann', '2002-09-11 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
