(121382, 5589, 2172, '<td valign="top">OK, well gonna just say it straight - I don''t like the over contrast/sharp spots - it distracts me - When I look at this, I keep focusing on those spots.  I understand that they are most likely from the light shining on the juice of the orange, but I believe that it can be avoided and still have the appearance of being wet.  Other than that, I really like this...Great orange color, Great composition and great execution of the black background.  Also good detail (aside from the contrasted areas).  Still wonderful work.  7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'OK, well gonna just say it straight - I don''t like the over contrast/sharp spots - it distracts me - When I look at this, I keep focusing on those spots.  I understand that they are most likely from the light shining on the juice of the orange, but I believe that it can be avoided and still have the appearance of being wet.  Other than that, I really like this...Great orange color, Great composition and great execution of the black background.  Also good detail (aside from the contrasted areas).  Still wonderful work.  7Ruthann', '2002-09-11 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121383, 5589, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2002-09-11 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
