(121396, 5591, 3178, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the mood this invokes with the title. Possibly you could have done moore with the lighting to give the front gourds a little more depth. Looks like the lighting is pretty much from the top, and maybe it should be lower and to the left? Looks like your background paper is a little wrinkled in back right too. It doesn''t really detract, but ya gotta watch that pesky paper.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the mood this invokes with the title. Possibly you could have done moore with the lighting to give the front gourds a little more depth. Looks like the lighting is pretty much from the top, and maybe it should be lower and to the left? Looks like your background paper is a little wrinkled in back right too. It doesn''t really detract, but ya gotta watch that pesky paper.', '2002-09-09 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121397, 5591, 255, '<td valign="top">this one jumped out at me as i was going thru the thumbnails! i love it. the DOF is perfect with the lonely gourd in the background, and the creativity of this photo is fabulous. very nice job! 9--amitchell</td>', 'this one jumped out at me as i was going thru the thumbnails! i love it. the DOF is perfect with the lonely gourd in the background, and the creativity of this photo is fabulous. very nice job! 9--amitchell', '2002-09-09 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
