(121399, 5591, 1877, '<td valign="top">I would hang this on my wall! I think your title really helps complete the photo. But.. as I look at it.. keeping the title out of view.. The soft focus/blur (whatever the technical term is) on the gourd (?) in the background helps to explain the photo too. When I first saw this, I thought.. #1!! Love it. Good job! 10 Jenguin</td>', 'I would hang this on my wall! I think your title really helps complete the photo. But.. as I look at it.. keeping the title out of view.. The soft focus/blur (whatever the technical term is) on the gourd (?) in the background helps to explain the photo too. When I first saw this, I thought.. #1!! Love it. Good job! 10 Jenguin', '2002-09-09 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
