(121408, 5591, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo. I like the fact the back *thing* is not in focus and the front is, and SOMEHOW you''ve managed to give the back fruit a sense of being upset. I like the nice vibrant colours against the white background aswell, but I think it would look a bit more vibrant if you darkened the brightness, and addeed a little bit of contrast, it wouls make the orange stand out more. 8 -- Konador</td>', 'This is a very good photo. I like the fact the back *thing* is not in focus and the front is, and SOMEHOW you''ve managed to give the back fruit a sense of being upset. I like the nice vibrant colours against the white background aswell, but I think it would look a bit more vibrant if you darkened the brightness, and addeed a little bit of contrast, it wouls make the orange stand out more. 8 -- Konador', '2002-09-11 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
