(121438, 5592, 1041, '<td valign="top">all in all the photo looks a little dark for me, and i''m wondering why you chose the background that you did.  it distracts me a little from the apple. interesting title.  -- gr8photos.</td>', 'all in all the photo looks a little dark for me, and i''m wondering why you chose the background that you did.  it distracts me a little from the apple. interesting title.  -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-10 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
