(121472, 5594, 2068, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great recreation.  The only critique I have is that the black seems to be overexposed.  I wish the shadow wasn''t there but it doesn''t take anything away from the image for me.  Good job.  9</td>', 'Great idea and great recreation.  The only critique I have is that the black seems to be overexposed.  I wish the shadow wasn''t there but it doesn''t take anything away from the image for me.  Good job.  9', '2002-09-09 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
