(121475, 5594, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. Great idea! Love the hat. Maybe we just don''t have enough art folks around here. The lighting seems a bit flat maybe and the apple color doesn''t pop like it could (the glare on it is distracting). The shadow on the wall is also a tad bothersome. Still, this photo stands out and is a great alternative to all the boring fruit pics. A+ for creativity even if it wasn''t original.  ~indigo997</td>', 'This is really cool. Great idea! Love the hat. Maybe we just don''t have enough art folks around here. The lighting seems a bit flat maybe and the apple color doesn''t pop like it could (the glare on it is distracting). The shadow on the wall is also a tad bothersome. Still, this photo stands out and is a great alternative to all the boring fruit pics. A+ for creativity even if it wasn''t original.  ~indigo997', '2002-09-09 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121476, 5594, 1379, '<td valign="top">Whaa?  How?</td>', 'Whaa?  How?', '2002-09-09 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121477, 5594, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great job!  My only suggestion for improvement would be to either make the shadow stronger with more lighting or get rid of it by having the subject step away from the wall. 9 Lisa</td>', 'Great job!  My only suggestion for improvement would be to either make the shadow stronger with more lighting or get rid of it by having the subject step away from the wall. 9 Lisa', '2002-09-09 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
