(121487, 5594, 2079, '<td valign="top">I love this, A masterpiece of a masterpiece. The concept is fabulous. There are quite a few art lovers on this sight, but I fear a large group of members may not understand exactly what you have accomplished here. Best wishes with this one.  9 Gotcha<br/></td>', 'I love this, A masterpiece of a masterpiece. The concept is fabulous. There are quite a few art lovers on this sight, but I fear a large group of members may not understand exactly what you have accomplished here. Best wishes with this one.  9 Gotcha', '2002-09-12 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121488, 5594, 1066, '<td valign="top">Very unique.  Creativity gets high marks from me and precise control of camera technique helps pull it together.  The only nits I have with the image is I was looking for a bit better detail in the hat/suit..its pretty dark on my monitor and my monitor is calibrated for magazine ad work (meaning as good as it gets).  Plus the background is a bit close causing a lineup shadow..If you could have had a backlit piece of plexiglass as a backdrop at about 6 feet back thats how most studio shots are done.  Still..exceptional..8..hokie</td>', 'Very unique.  Creativity gets high marks from me and precise control of camera technique helps pull it together.  The only nits I have with the image is I was looking for a bit better detail in the hat/suit..its pretty dark on my monitor and my monitor is calibrated for magazine ad work (meaning as good as it gets).  Plus the background is a bit close causing a lineup shadow..If you could have had a backlit piece of plexiglass as a backdrop at about 6 feet back thats how most studio shots are done.  Still..exceptional..8..hokie', '2002-09-12 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121489, 5594, 2223, '<td valign="top">hi club...nice pic 8--shutterfly</td>', 'hi club...nice pic 8--shutterfly', '2002-09-12 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121490, 5594, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Nice effect.  To me, this seems so "do-able", the admin note wasn''t needed.  Did you use a pencil or a fork?  The only suggestion I can think of, shorten the pencil/fork/whatever to have the apple closer to the model (or a smaller apple) to expose a tad more face.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Nice effect.  To me, this seems so "do-able", the admin note wasn''t needed.  Did you use a pencil or a fork?  The only suggestion I can think of, shorten the pencil/fork/whatever to have the apple closer to the model (or a smaller apple) to expose a tad more face.  9 Swash', '2002-09-12 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121491, 5594, 3087, '<td valign="top">Why did this need to be validated by the administrators?<br/>Anyway, I do like the idea, very witty - and more of an impersonation than a copy of someone else''s art!<br/>Make the tie knot bigger. And the apple looks a little pale.<br/>:)<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Why did this need to be validated by the administrators?Anyway, I do like the idea, very witty - and more of an impersonation than a copy of someone else''s art!Make the tie knot bigger. And the apple looks a little pale.:)6, Kavey', '2002-09-13 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121492, 5594, 436, '<td valign="top">when you find out why that nasty shadow is on the wall behind him, please tell us al.  Superb idea and composition.  Very well done. 9</td>', 'when you find out why that nasty shadow is on the wall behind him, please tell us al.  Superb idea and composition.  Very well done. 9', '2002-09-13 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
