(121527, 5595, 3818, '<td valign="top">Good colors and detail...wow! These strawberries are making my mouth water! I like the simplicity of colors...red, blue and green, which are all bright and complimentary to each other. I think the composition suffers a little from not having a main focal point...one strawberry that is more predominantly placed. The most predominant one is moving out of the picture and has it''s leaves trimmed off a bit. A very good effort, not perfect, but certainly better than average.</td>', 'Good colors and detail...wow! These strawberries are making my mouth water! I like the simplicity of colors...red, blue and green, which are all bright and complimentary to each other. I think the composition suffers a little from not having a main focal point...one strawberry that is more predominantly placed. The most predominant one is moving out of the picture and has it''s leaves trimmed off a bit. A very good effort, not perfect, but certainly better than average.', '2002-09-10 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
