(121580, 5599, 1066, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been commenting for a few weeks but this photo sorta begged me for a comment.  I guess that is a good thing:-)<br/><br/>The idea is interesting but I feel as if the nude male is added gratuitously...Plus the fact he is obviously a man but with the feet not touching the ground and in a corner like that he is reverting back to childhood.<br/><br/>The whole shot has a disturbing sorta fetish feel about it..very manipulating but it feels dishonest in relation to the challenge.  So the emotion generated here is lost by making me feel like somebody is acting rather than being true.....sorta psuedo intellectual stuff that tends to turn me off..personal preference.<br/><br/>The technical stuff like lighting and the shadow to the side and the lighting of the eggplant etc are also personally not interesting to the shot but thats subjective.<br/><br/>The emotional context is good so points for that..the challenge is o.k. but the underlying dishonesty makes me feel very negative to the photo....7..hokie<br/><br/>upgraded to a 7...made me think more than most photos and that means something to me</td>', 'I haven''t been commenting for a few weeks but this photo sorta begged me for a comment.  I guess that is a good thing:-)The idea is interesting but I feel as if the nude male is added gratuitously...Plus the fact he is obviously a man but with the feet not touching the ground and in a corner like that he is reverting back to childhood.The whole shot has a disturbing sorta fetish feel about it..very manipulating but it feels dishonest in relation to the challenge.  So the emotion generated here is lost by making me feel like somebody is acting rather than being true.....sorta psuedo intellectual stuff that tends to turn me off..personal preference.The technical stuff like lighting and the shadow to the side and the lighting of the eggplant etc are also personally not interesting to the shot but thats subjective.The emotional context is good so points for that..the challenge is o.k. but the underlying dishonesty makes me feel very negative to the photo....7..hokieupgraded to a 7...made me think more than most photos and that means something to me', '2002-09-10 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
