(121584, 5599, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think there is a pun, or message that I''m missing here.  I''m not going to mark down for that though, it''s my fault.  The photos it''s self is fairly interesting.  What really caught my eye is the size of the chairs.  Are they more like stools?  Everything is nice where the eggplant is concerned.  The lighting, angle and clarity are all good.  Some might comment on the glare, but I don''t think it''s strong enough to be distracting.  The naked guy in the back is a little dark for my taste, however, I think that is what you were going for.  Kind of trying to emphasize the eggplant, while keeping the naked guy in the back, but still in the photo.  Overall interesting photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~</td>', 'I think there is a pun, or message that I''m missing here.  I''m not going to mark down for that though, it''s my fault.  The photos it''s self is fairly interesting.  What really caught my eye is the size of the chairs.  Are they more like stools?  Everything is nice where the eggplant is concerned.  The lighting, angle and clarity are all good.  Some might comment on the glare, but I don''t think it''s strong enough to be distracting.  The naked guy in the back is a little dark for my taste, however, I think that is what you were going for.  Kind of trying to emphasize the eggplant, while keeping the naked guy in the back, but still in the photo.  Overall interesting photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~HBunch7187~', '2002-09-10 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121585, 5599, 3294, '<td valign="top">I am sad to say I do not like this shot.  The message is not clear to me and while I prefer "alternative" scenes, this one appears artsy for the sake of artsiness.  The lighting appears shallow while parts of the foreground chair are bright.  Maybe I''m just confused???</td>', 'I am sad to say I do not like this shot.  The message is not clear to me and while I prefer "alternative" scenes, this one appears artsy for the sake of artsiness.  The lighting appears shallow while parts of the foreground chair are bright.  Maybe I''m just confused???', '2002-09-11 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121586, 5599, 3178, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand this image, but I''m pretty sure I don''t want to! hah. 1 for meeting the challenge plus 2 for making some connection between naked and eggplant equals 3.<br/></td>', 'I''m not sure I understand this image, but I''m pretty sure I don''t want to! hah. 1 for meeting the challenge plus 2 for making some connection between naked and eggplant equals 3.', '2002-09-11 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121587, 5599, 133, '<td valign="top">Do NOT understand this shot.</td>', 'Do NOT understand this shot.', '2002-09-11 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121588, 5599, 2337, '<td valign="top">There might be some kind of ''high art'' thing happening here, but I don''t see it.  The composition is strained at best, and the lighting seems very strange.  The subject matter is also just plain confussing.  What is this suppose to be a picture of?</td>', 'There might be some kind of ''high art'' thing happening here, but I don''t see it.  The composition is strained at best, and the lighting seems very strange.  The subject matter is also just plain confussing.  What is this suppose to be a picture of?', '2002-09-11 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121589, 5599, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is a hard image to assimilate and understand. I dont feel I was able to get the message, but I believe it''s there. I think it''s deserving and interesting. I price the effort to do something unique and deep. I don''t think people here will get it, since they have shown to be very uneasy with what they don''t understand. I am sure a simple well executed photo of a pretty and colorful fruit will win. I would be very interested in learning your vision for this rendering.</td>', 'This is a hard image to assimilate and understand. I dont feel I was able to get the message, but I believe it''s there. I think it''s deserving and interesting. I price the effort to do something unique and deep. I don''t think people here will get it, since they have shown to be very uneasy with what they don''t understand. I am sure a simple well executed photo of a pretty and colorful fruit will win. I would be very interested in learning your vision for this rendering.', '2002-09-11 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121590, 5599, 2700, '<td valign="top">lighting is good, except that I see reflection on the chair and the fruit. I also don''t have a taste for this sort of subjectmatter. Perhaps if you were to have a nude woman....</td>', 'lighting is good, except that I see reflection on the chair and the fruit. I also don''t have a taste for this sort of subjectmatter. Perhaps if you were to have a nude woman....', '2002-09-11 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
