(121631, 5600, 3178, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. elegant and simple. I love the way the pepper glows from the inside. The seeds hanging on the inside, and laid across the front give the shot a casual natural look. Nice angle for the shot, showing the inside on the left and the outside on the right.  If I was going to pick nits, I''d say that it would have been nice if your DOF had included the seeds in front. Oh, and your pepper has a birth mark on the right! :) Good job, you obviously spent a lot of time getting this just right! (9) - chrisab</td>', 'Very nice.. elegant and simple. I love the way the pepper glows from the inside. The seeds hanging on the inside, and laid across the front give the shot a casual natural look. Nice angle for the shot, showing the inside on the left and the outside on the right.  If I was going to pick nits, I''d say that it would have been nice if your DOF had included the seeds in front. Oh, and your pepper has a birth mark on the right! :) Good job, you obviously spent a lot of time getting this just right! (9) - chrisab', '2002-09-13 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
