(121687, 5601, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s so cool! I love the weird drama you created here. It''s like Clint Eastwood staring down some punk. I have no idea what that has to do with bananas, but it''s kind of surreal and I like that. 10 for creativity - lisae</td>', 'That''s so cool! I love the weird drama you created here. It''s like Clint Eastwood staring down some punk. I have no idea what that has to do with bananas, but it''s kind of surreal and I like that. 10 for creativity - lisae', '2002-09-15 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
