(121716, 5603, 3354, '<td valign="top">Wow. Another nice mushroom shot. I love light. Look at the beautiful out of focus light noise in the background. That looks sweet. Then the clear mushroom, totally in focus with a soft blue hue on it. Beautiful wood grain. This is an amazing picture.  I hope you get a good overall rank. I''m marking this pretty high. - phlebotiss</td>', 'Wow. Another nice mushroom shot. I love light. Look at the beautiful out of focus light noise in the background. That looks sweet. Then the clear mushroom, totally in focus with a soft blue hue on it. Beautiful wood grain. This is an amazing picture.  I hope you get a good overall rank. I''m marking this pretty high. - phlebotiss', '2002-09-09 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
